{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:52:17.579061+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5f48676c1c2a9694794e9854a9008f4ddba378c0e19e77d86b3398c610022543","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition d:MartP of arXiv:2411.14936, 'Massive Particle Systems,\\Wasserstein Brownian Motions,\\ and the Dean--Kawasaki Equation'] Fix a Borel probability measure~$\mu$ on~$M$, with~$\mu\ll\mssm$.
