{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:54:10.964263+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5f5484a37dd870a35311131b9d1ede7c7d317a930d5711c22e2e75a005b8e1fd","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 4 of arXiv:2606.12720, 'On McDiarmid's Inequality under Dependence \\ via Approximate Tensorization of Entropy'] {Entropy Tensorization (Lemma 4.1, \cite{caputo2022})}


