{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:33:17.741158+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5f657426ae32b92c5b79b5e9d0e16c60418ef1cdddb7f4019bfc33df13e07bd2","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 111 (Stochastic Fubini and covariance density) of arXiv:2607.10813, '2607.10813'] At finite cutoff, $\partial_t^\nu V_{a,\Lambda}$ is a homogeneous colored second chaos.  Its covariance spectral density is
