{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:46:36.161931+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5fc856750c08a0f0d217c4cd333de7ad910f795bc3d8308158f609e011b957f0","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop Prop_UniversalBundleOfZ2ZSpinors of arXiv:2609.02848, 'The universal moduli space of non-degenerate $\Z/2\Z$~harmonic spinors'] The \defined{universal bundle of $\mathbb{Z}/2\mathbb{Z}$ spinors}
  \begin{equation*}
