\item the vector~$\lambda$ satisfies the relation~$\lambda M=\lambda$.
\end{enumerate}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:15:34.557397+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5fd8785a38d9f35f2bffa36a5d1dd4aea71829172f91845fa1adc61c1761766a","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 47 (the flow equation for $(h^2)''$) of arXiv:2609.03332, 'Singularity Models of Finite-Time K\"ahler-Ricci Flows'] On $\{ 0 \leq f_1^2 \leq L (t) ,\; 0 \leq t < T \}$,
