{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:15:15.481135+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5fee05022d95e7bef21dc149ca47302e4389b90d5ab6f117d2e8baaf054311cf","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem PCM-product of arXiv:2507.01406, '{\Large On Iterated Lorenz Curves with Applications: The Multivariate Case }'] \medskip \noindent  Let $d=2m$, and let $F$ be PCM with
