{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:51:33.327534+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5ff16bb5f5d3b823f8470f0d917ef27a6c5b710627c734a99b40e52990c13ac2","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop resp-stability-G-gl of arXiv:2608.28504, 'Global $\bm\infty$-categories and global Thom spectra'] Let $G$ be any compact Lie group and let $V$ be a $G$-representation. Then both adjoints in
    \[
