{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:20:55.559091+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_600102b0303bce3df9bdee946ee8a26da965f3707fc2ed20ae5a9f222af7b44d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:multiplication-formula of arXiv:2411.07680, 'Energy solutions of singular SPDEs on Hilbert spaces with applications to domains with bou'] Let $\delta$ be the Skorokhod integral and
  let $D$ be the Malliavin derivative, both with respect to the white noise on
  $H$. Let $F \in \mathcal{C}$ and let $\varphi \in \ensuremath{\operatorname{dom}} (\delta)$. Then
  \begin{equation}
    F \delta (\varphi) = \delta (F \varphi) + \langle D F, \varphi \rangle_H .

