{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:57:07.309761+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6059d6dbe2fa1d9bbf23d911fc1c252b06473038f797babee618359a703d764d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 12 of arXiv:2606.24485, 'On the convex hull of a planar Brownian bridge with a random Gaussian endpoint'] For every $\sigma \in [0,1]$, one has
