    \mathbb E_{w\sim\eta}|\Pi_w\,z|^2\ \leq\ \Bigr(1-\inf_{|\zeta|=1}\mathbb E_{w\sim\eta}\Bigr(\zeta\cdot\frac{w}{|w|}\Bigr)^2\Bigr)\,|z|^2 \;. 
