{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:07:15.757626+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_60a2cffa50ab18958a40f536ddf4c81224e9ca9b71c1c957ca041b22c4373f0b","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:coherent-gmc-lines of arXiv:2608.02459, 'Response Calculus for Spectral Simplicity\\ and Joint Eigenvalue Densities'] The family (equation eq:coherent-line-gmc of the paper) satisfies
