{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:11:35.825577+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_60af28aff1fac513753e8e38bb57617c8bb86930daa43238fa426b15ee9d50ec","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:particle_confinement of arXiv:2607.22908, 'Epidemic Phase Transitions in the Zero-Range Process'] There exists a constant $C_{\textnormal{\tiny (C:confinement of the paper)}}>0$ such that
