{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:22:20.952255+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_60afe1336ff5b7ea83412b98f9a8ae34a52eb0f060976148b87ab29cbeb89c2b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 11 of arXiv:2604.05234, 'Quantitative propagation of chaos and universality for asymmetric Langevin spin glass dyna'] Let $\mu \in \mP(\mC_T)$ be the solution to \eqref{eq: limit dynamics 0} and $Y \sim \mu$. Then we have
