{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:31:57.856380+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_60b1ec309b5074cfb63647f614dd8e2ce3c836c5c881090f3a3819d8dd31bf99","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma pisierXfreebound of arXiv:2510.01021, '\Large Random Matrices, Intrinsic Freeness, and Sharp Non-Asymptotic Inequalities\relatedv'] [Pisier~[Pisier2003IntroductionTO]; see also~[bandeira2023free])]

