{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:02:11.268511+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_60d383efd91670f9b3a14ee6cc8cf7025bf854f5230abaa6652640da88150329","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:supermartingale of arXiv:2509.08430, 'One-dimensional particle clouds with elastic collisions'] Suppose that $\nu \geq 2$, and that $j \in [\nu-1]$ is such that $v_j = v_{j+1}$, with the notation from~(equation eq:slopes of the paper).
