{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:17:04.325520+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_60d96f3450f4cf23bf46f3d04d1fede4f095b9b7c1c4e78bdd0a80e9cc27c520","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition thm:AuxApprox of arXiv:2606.01866, 'Phase Transition of a Semiflexible Membrane in Two Dimensions'] Fix $\lambda<0$, $d=2$, and let $G_N$ and $\bar{G}_N$ be as in (equation eq:cl of the paper) and (equation eq:ss of the paper), respectively. For a fixed $\delta\in(0,1)$ and $x,y\in V_N^\delta$, we have
