{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:49:06.312005+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_60fa75474878c59bde61ada9ff07af1fd0beb7ee2522afaf713a971ed1874fe2","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem th:main2 of arXiv:2601.07759, 'The value of random zero-sum games'] We fix $n\geq 2$. The value of the random game defined by 
