{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:40.359337+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_610305e00c7aad0789a8f02e6de3bef3b11361cd28ca4c9adba95fe5bf252e9c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 21 of arXiv:2511.09517, 'From Cannings model to Brownian motion conditioned on local time profile'] Assume \eqref{H1} and \eqref{eq:3rd}. For any $\delta>0$ and $m\ge 1$, uniformly for $\delta n \le s \le h(q_n)-\delta n$, we have
