For every fixed
$f\in\operatorname{Lip}((X,\rho);1)$, let $\hat{f}\ensuremath{\stackrel{\mbox{\upshape\tiny def.}}{=}} \hat{f}_{\mathbb{D}_N}^{(\beta,q_\varepsilon,1)}$ be as in~(equation eq:formula__realizable of the paper).  Then:
