{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:28:08.691452+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_61d09d668738af73f0373882441f7d1e37ad7daaeedd8fdea1b962c51cbb1b37","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 10 of arXiv:2607.29534, 'Expected signatures via partial integration, coordinate change and symmetrization'] Consider the following system of equations for a sequences $(\Psi^{-1}_w)_{w\in \mathcal{W}_\mathcal{A}} \subset \R\langle \mathcal A\rangle$:
