{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:12:19.496332+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_61f54193a10d581e223dc9ab1f922624eaeb01a5683f0217a5560542f66d3c99","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 18 of arXiv:2608.18075, '2608.18075'] For $z\in\mathsf X$ and $h\in E_z$, define
