{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:17.749818+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_62189fcd488eb570b374b413d3cd6e4ef00e7068dcf18baa28e4420529e768ad","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 25 of arXiv:2511.01456, 'Zero distribution of multiplicative Hermite and Laguerre polynomials'] For all $k\in \N$, the $k$-th moment of $\nu_{\beta, \gamma}$ is given by
