{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:22:08.538925+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6220003e4f15bd2552b6fbbaaa62a21ad464ee0a38f1bfed5f02d8fb2ba32d0a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:S6V-dressing of arXiv:2608.02772, 'Non-Abelian Hirota-Miwa Equations for the KPZ Universality Class'] The kernel $K_{t,x,m}$ satisfies the rank-one
