\end{align} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:33:46.773951+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_62282c722c8b9e15ab919e04228a9c84f5a9158372f067d7ab87c9f158c7c4d1","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 72 of arXiv:2603.24616, 'Pinning in non-critical half-space geometric last passage percolation'] Assume the notation from Definition \ref{Def.AuxLE2}. Define the $\llbracket 1,2k_1 + 2\rrbracket$-indexed geometric line ensemble $\tilde{\mathfrak{L}}^{\mathrm{bot},N} = \{\tilde{L}^{\mathrm{bot},N}_{i}\}_{i = 1}^{2k_1 + 2}$ on $\llbracket 0, \hat{B}_N\rrbracket$, by
