minimizes $f_{\ell^2}$ on $\Cc$ for every $\ell$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:40.352125+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6239d63293301c3c9992af28ad48e1fa8de4493d66a9922f7bcd16cecec8df7d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 16 of arXiv:2511.07350, 'Decoupling of clusters in independent sets in a percolated hypercube'] There is some $\gamma > 0$ such that for all $p > \fr{1}{2} - \gamma$, we have
