{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:16:46.703005+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_62729891d1249a5d2abea6672588c55ff2c9e4e8b640b86cbf157849ebd5f2ef","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemFderivs of arXiv:2411.18563, 'Lower tails for triangles inside the critical window'] The partial derivatives of $f(\Delta,\lambda,\zeta)$ satisfy
