{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:47:07.700708+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6294334c87c8659118db0f607bcde9effd93c0bf7254230053ab25a372ef89ef","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 4 of arXiv:2608.06011, 'Strong averaging principle for multiscale time-inhomogeneous SDEs with multiplicative $\al'] For any $y,z\in\br^d$ and $p\in(1,\alpha)$, let $D$ be a $d\times d$ matrix. Define
