{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:34:45.725917+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_62b3b7d74b1544c8e5fad8d141130df376caf83003d5b943ac788420bb0a8011","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Lemma-Separated-Time of arXiv:2609.01964, 'The critical exponent for the two-dimensional semilinear wave equation with strong damping'] There exist $\kappa\in\left(0,\frac1{100}\right)$, $T_1\geqslant T_0$ and $c_1>0$ such that
