{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:04:39.220092+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_62f6dae6fb1b0ffb26e46984628a30eea8a4210f331fe8578f6e58d065be5a40","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn 6 of arXiv:2608.13976, 'Boundary Harnack principle for diffusion with jumps on metric measure spaces'] \begin{enumerate}
