{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:56:36.586492+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_632d617eb36476632080118824813f92eb2d3c5c53be781a81a93e66791f90fc","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm intro-thm-1 of arXiv:2608.30518, 'Grow-up rates of inhomogeneous semilinear heat equations in the critical dimension'] Assume that $N\ge 11$ and $0\le f\le f_H$ in $B_1$ in addition to the hypotheses of Proposition (intro-prop-1 of the paper). 
