{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:16:46.704842+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_63c74a2754ae2b057bbc3cb854913016c0d65893b114a65289b893a52d8eded8","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemMeanFieldBound of arXiv:2411.18563, 'Lower tails for triangles inside the critical window'] Fix $\eta \in [0,1)$. For every $\varepsilon>0$, there exists $C>0$ so that if $p \ge C/\sqrt{n}$,
