{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:25:35.657232+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_63e6002c30d8dbd3a35be002d24b6896a7d543a9f76465a9eb68bd1503428c33","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma bound_separating of arXiv:2603.05491, '\textbf{Local limits of uniform triangulations with boundaries in high genus}'] For all $n,g \ge 0$ such that $n \ge 2g-1$, we have
