{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:02:34.832841+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_63f9fde5ca7da0040f96a922c243d9c0f53f8bc5743737d035330d2769e83fb8","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 4 (Matrix-variate Laplace-transform order) of arXiv:2607.20329, '2607.20329'] This order was introduced for real symmetric matrices in
