{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:53:51.337682+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_645d138cd9dd0569aad9238cd24357a34345e8554a4d80b841c6d4697023d95e","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:invariance of arXiv:2605.03896, 'Dimer models on astroidal zig-zag graphs'] The formula (equation eq:formula_inverse_K of the paper) is:
