{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:15:15.527563+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_64732fa398322d4963a2261312e5159c48c5abc4da22451ab72eff53669afe66","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma marginal-lipschitz-from-denominator of arXiv:2507.01406, '{\Large On Iterated Lorenz Curves with Applications: The Multivariate Case }'] \textbf{ }\noindent Under the
