{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:55:37.869316+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_64e3c9c08c3be474850aac1bbc0f3e08c0111804e9dc87d82da74acd482cb039","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theo thm:regularforitselfregularlyvarying of arXiv:2605.06488, 'Continuous-state branching processes with L\'evy-Khintchine drift-interaction: Laplace dua'] Let $\Psi=\Sigma-\Phi$ and $\hat{\Psi}=\hat\Sigma-\hat\Phi$ be mechanisms such that 
