{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:16:18.679767+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_64f50d6d1f1a29d3a9635ff74dfea5b1664f8f4ac65647509c8e16df9e6fb736","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 6 of arXiv:2607.25986, 'Asymptotics of a two-species particle system associated to the doubly parabolic Keller-Seg'] Consider the process $(U^{1,N,M,\e}_t)_{t\geq 0}$ defined by
