{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:47:21.594726+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_650a7a2f5e042b89c573ff9b572c0d8b42a251ab485fdd172533fe3dacd42856","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma-5.2 of arXiv:2412.08964, 'Phase transition and critical behavior in hierarchical\\integer-valued Gaussian and Coulom'] Suppose that~$f\colon\mathbb R\to\mathbb R$ admits the Fourier representation
