{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:36:04.962916+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6585b071cbdb5c4f496e4994cb8b5a6ff89e9010d4b4005050be6cfb3374a6cf","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 12 (Four-point correlation bound) of arXiv:2604.00692, 'Uniform-in-time diffusion approximations for multiscale stochastic systems'] Let $f\in L^\infty(\mT^d)$ be centered such that $\mu(f)=0$. For any ordered times $0 \leq r_1 \leq r_2 \leq r_3 \leq r_4$, the unperturbed diffusion $X$ satisfies
