{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:14:57.635220+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_658773eda96337880133859f7d75ab4823f9ad87b0c72d95c5f1b9ab309f1ed5","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor: equivalent asymptotique d lambda fois caractère à une certaine puissance r fini pour les caractères peu de points fixes of arXiv:2605.28770, 'Cutoff profiles for conjugacy invariant random walks on symmetric groups'] Let $r\geq 0$. For each $n\geq 1$, let $\sigma_n\in {\ensuremath{\mathfrak{S}}} _n$.
