{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:00:30.489481+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6594d5c3de701fa65f0c45dddff4071cd4f8429193141e0d683541a135c4ef06","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 16 of arXiv:2607.03924, 'Tree Coordinates and Range Martingales for Positive Operator-Valued Measures'] Let $c>0$. The assignment 
