{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:38:57.118272+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_65d62c59bbdd3cca1d447e96c9f744454fbd60bb910e63feb7972b0a64f688ef","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 28 of arXiv:2604.04823, '2604.04823'] Let~$a\geq1$ and suppose~$a\sqrt{\epsilon}$ is sufficiently small, and~$h\leq \epsilon^2$.
