{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:34:45.627613+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6643ce66bea31599ab195a567289ca68bca917c356ce8d847429af96a6ae8f45","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:boundary_theta_bound of arXiv:2609.01825, 'On everywhere locally soluble varieties \\ in families over toric bases'] Let $\vec \alpha \in \mathbb R_{> 0}^s$ and $\vec \varpi_i \in \mathbb R_{\geq  0}^s$ for $i = 1, \dots, k$. Let $\vec \ell$ be of convergent type for the face $\cal F$ and assume that $\cal F$ is not contained in a coordinate hyperplane. Moreover, let $\vec W = (\log (B/X_1), \ldots, \log (B/X_k))$ with sufficiently large $B$ and $X_i \ll (\log B)^N$ for some $N\in \mathbb{R}_{>1}$. Write
	\begin{equation*}
		\Xi = \cal P(\vec W + (\gamma \log \theta, \dots, \gamma \log \theta)) \setminus \cal P(\vec W - (\gamma \log \theta, \dots, \gamma \log \theta)).
	\end{equation*}
	Then for every $\delta'>0$ there exists $\epsilon >0$ such that for $1<\theta \leq 1 + (\log B)^{-\delta'}$ we have
\begin{equation*}
\int_{\Xi} \prod_{i=1}^s \mathrm e^{t_i} (1 + t_i)^{\ell_i} \,\mathrm d\vec t\ll_{\gamma} B^a (\log B)^{d+\ell-\epsilon}.
\end{equation*}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:48:49.891949+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_664436104c8bbfd95c07e4fcb1c7c94cd7823ae3d3ff0f2773e42bd91b20fcdc","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theo integralsqW of arXiv:2510.23430, 'On the Martin boundary for discrete TASEP'] {BW17},[BK21]}] Let $\lambda$ be a partition and $k$ be an integer such that $\lambda_1\leq k$. Assume that there exists a complex positively-oriented simple contour $\mathcal C$  such that
\begin{itemize}
