{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:41:19.326702+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6659cd4d5aeef6f65c2c6a0b9174573ea9928fdca1f86bbe93dc0e525d5ff190","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:asymptotic-nonorientability of arXiv:2609.03532, 'Airy limit for the Jack process and topological expansion'] For $g\in\frac12\mathbb Z_{\geq0}$ and $0\leq\eta\leq2g$, the limit
