{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:32:23.873498+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6690a9459a21b29e3b0f611f649047b1866831dbf8303fd3138e900c5e0ec5e4","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma_app_c of arXiv:2603.26307, '\LARGE The incompressible Navier--Stokes--Fourier system with thermal noise'] Let $Y_1\hookrightarrow  Y_\alpha \hookrightarrow Y_0$ be Banach spaces, such that $Y_0 \ni  y\mapsto \|y\|_{Y_1} \in \mathbb{R}$ is lower semicontinuous and  the interpolation inequality
