{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:47:12.034228+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_66aa0277e206763f99c829ba463320eb49a364ffd4d5e7dbcbd3272891923885","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem-Ito formula Tanaka trick of arXiv:2512.17727, 'Stochastic transport equation with L\'evy noise'] {Under the assumptions of Theorem (reg of the paper),
