{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:26:20.447768+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_66aad4786566b09b4d6d37507b08888ca5339442309fa92819593ceb7f0fbb5a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem lemma: single vertex pinching cancellations of arXiv:2411.11676, 'Surface sums for lattice Yang--Mills in the large-$N$ limit'] Fix a blue face $B$ with disjoint vertices and a vertex $v$ of $B$. Then 
