{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:11:02.383066+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_66ca5967542686bb8c8fa7edb5deca367f0da8b476f23a2c9bb80a70d4026cd1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:local_hajek of arXiv:2507.10531, 'Quantitative central limit theorems for exponential random graphs'] As in (equation eq:hatngrhovdef of the paper), let us write
\begin{equation}
