{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:48:47.283087+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_66e918357edd6d68441fa512594aaefc3ff36c3eb22bd54055ddc2328baed867","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem th:CLT of arXiv:2604.20327, 'Persistent Homology of the Wiener Sausage II: A Central Limit Theorem for Drifted Planar B'] Let $\psi$ be a bounded Borel function supported in a compact interval
