{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:02:34.839768+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_66fdf5c5c0e2f8cd323fabf09f19f8143ddb9bda98bb1db56d882c2747eed9ca","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 12 (Tubular criterion) of arXiv:2607.20680, 'Exact Scale--Shape Factorization of the Typical Poisson--Voronoi Cell Volume in Arbitrary '] Define the zero-degeneracy locus by
