{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:16:49.561018+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6720a5bb9c137e3a1ea59b90e2cdb7443c79fe07bacc0dd49fc2eea9914947f4","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defs 58 (Conditional irreducibility) of arXiv:2509.06869, 'Infinite Interacting Brownian Motions and EVI Gradient Flows'] \normalfont
