{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:25:40.163480+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6746229d952af9a2f10c4b154db1ee6d994ebe5eaae2737a13c80475d5408d40","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem Jac-thm of arXiv:2609.00592, 'Bounded cohomology property on Jacobian elliptic surfaces with simplicial Mori cones'] Let $X$ be a Jacobian elliptic surface with finite Mordell-Weil group and  exactly one reducible fiber. 
