{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:28.484884+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_675971428d46aad6c8bbb8888870305fd228d41048dbfce5ab366e653467f5ea","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 132 (Dyadic summation in the gap lattice) of arXiv:2606.29292, 'Intrinsic Gaussian Tensor Geometry and Random Operator Spectra'] Let $1\le q<\infty$, and identify a dyadic array
