{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:24:25.929169+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_67686a1be32cbddd61b70a9342cb536e1ad7bf127f7aeb75caa17e24700d74e3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 4 of arXiv:2505.16701, 'Open interacting particle systems and Ising measures'] (1) Let the interaction parameter $\epsilon$ be in the range $0<|\epsilon|<1$.
