&P_tf(x)\left\|\sum_{i'=1}^{r+1}\alpha_{i'}\prod_{j=1}^{i'-1}B_{j}\nabla^{(i')}\ln P_tf(x)\right\|_{A_0}^2\le P_t\left(f\left\|\sum_{i'=1}^{r+1}\left(\sum_{i=0}^{i'-1}\alpha_{i'-i}\frac{t^i}{i!} \prod_{j=1}^{i'-1}B_{j}\right)\nabla^{(i')}\ln f\right\|^2_{A_0}\right)(x),
