where $\alpha_1=1$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:39:18.520341+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6787ccff10068adce4840e2e22e14d507f80536233a27777770a90edc16d3538","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theoreme 5 of arXiv:2609.02267, 'Locally Conformally Flat Manifolds with Positive Scalar Curvature: Kleinian Groups, Moduli'] Let \((M^n,g)\), \(n \ge 3\), be a complete, open, simply connected, locally
