{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:33:11.958102+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_67881fbcfbbeaa7eb4743fc1ad9b1912c3e3a28532940dc4a877cd32f3644a88","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition eq:F-properties of arXiv:2607.14087, 'Stochastic Domination of Gaussian Maxima: A Resolution of the Weak Simplex Conjecture'] \label[proposition]{prop:tilt-functions}
