{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:38:17.819912+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_679563ef8d2042b125fe29892f2baa8b1cf25164da68dbfd8448454dadf042b1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition p.abmnfacts of arXiv:2510.07682, 'From tug-of-war to Brownian Boost: \\ explicit ODE solutions for player-funded stochastic-'] Let $(a,b,m,n) \in$ \textrm{ABMN}($\kappa,\rho$)  and let $i \in \ensuremath{\mathbb{Z}}$.
