{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:33:17.680261+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_67f6eb638fb1f024018ffa164111a4a3fdb3db70ad9343634ec2604ef9bcea7a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 11 of arXiv:2607.10769, '\fontsize{14}{17}\selectfont\bfseries Sharp Poincar\'e interpolation along Wasserstein geo'] Let $\kappa>0$, and let $\mu$ have potential $V$ with
$V-\kappa|x|^2/2$ convex. Let $\xi\sim\mu$ and
