{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:04:30.599680+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_67fcf485599675e8b1d80bf95dbdbafd83dbd3f225326b5b08eea45d48471738","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:ALE of arXiv:2411.10586, 'A convergence framework for Airy$_\beta$ line ensemble\\ via pole evolution'] ALE$_\beta$ is an ordered families of continuous random processes
