{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:35:59.944246+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_682ec72469bff20ed132cbb072eccb15f7971138e920f2c9c920cb01324032bf","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 18 (Uniform \(\ell^1\) bound for \(\IK\)) of arXiv:2608.26259, 'Cutoff with an $O(1)$ window for Potts Glauber Dynamics\\on lattice at High Temperature'] There exists \(C_{\IK,1}<\infty\) such that for all integers \(t\ge0\),
