{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:42:08.467609+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_682ee232df28f608dc5b9e8715ec51f66e0510ca04dcb81892fea4a2c0d0dc7b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Palm-Lcal-iin of arXiv:2511.15893, 'On a Class of Dynamical Poisson-Voronoi Tessellations'] For $l\in [n]$ and for all non-negative measurable functions $f$ on $(\Omega,{\mathcal F })$,

\begin{align}
