{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:52:47.244532+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_689b4739b04b85789502ec763e3ecf15b324bd76920117afb4b25790fc778aa4","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 18 (Hodge a priori estimates: general rhs) of arXiv:2609.01093, 'Ideal MHD below the classical well-posedness threshold'] Let $\Ufield=dw$ be exact, let $X=\mathrm{id}+w$, recall $\sigma=s-1>(n-1)/2$,
