{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:20:15.492179+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_68dae9c19120de8573790eeb4d8293b82e2aaeb022efe11e3ec9cfe08c883ecc","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 29 of arXiv:2509.09589, 'Geometry of critical discrete structures: long-range percolation on the hierarchical latti'] [Upper bound]
	\begin{enumeratea}
		\item
		Let $\alpha\in (0, d)$ and $\alpha < \theta < \min\{ 2\alpha, \alpha + d/3 \}$.
