{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:09:34.454837+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_68f432a7dd2d1f7ecaa910763ed4d65c2531a160d3659df5149db0037183b73c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition tau of arXiv:2505.11721, 'Variational principles for Hausdorff and packing dimensions of fractal percolation on self'] Fix $q \in \left(1,2\right]$ such that $\phi_{W^{(n)}}(q)<+\infty$ for all $n\ge 1$. One has 
