{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:44:12.642301+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6936a1a19f4b7c686b70deb3da08989c173f70324e04c1e3ab75a88a5a9da909","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:PW of arXiv:2512.04371, 'Constructive Approximation under Carleman's Condition, \\ with Applications to Smoothed An'] For every $f\in PW_{\Omega}$ the Fourier inversion formula gives an
