    \end{split}
  \end{equation} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:37:08.314843+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6994a3d14e86358d6a9beaab10a74635b57d7b127ff3a3e1edbedfeaf88d4f06","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm:facetinvariance of arXiv:2608.30973, 'Pseudo-Anosov flow and dynamics on guts'] Let \(M\) be an oriented connected closed 3-manifold and let \(\varphi\) be a pseudo-Anosov flow without perfect fits in \(M\). Suppose that \(z\in \mathcal{C}_{2}(\varphi)\) is primitive.

