{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:45:01.871822+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6995cf6b366cf37c804306ffea95badc6c7884671f4d87bddf3c0f7ce2c55d3e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma coupling of arXiv:2512.19897, 'On the convoy of the ASEP speed process'] We have:
