{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:55:57.008885+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6998a5888f3aa95e795b250d8dc20ed52d6974801a5c3f8a30476acec186d546","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 17 of arXiv:2609.02808, 'Minimizers of Laplace eigenvalues under a lower curvature bound'] For every $\ell\ge1$ and $0<\alpha\le1$,
