{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:46:25.316179+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_69bf9cbdaa65cf8c1c9833408831bb05bf138897b6a144e17af6895223d32b75","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem ;laltu of arXiv:2604.12462, 'Stochastic analysis of Beckner's and related functional inequalities'] We have 
