{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:09:49.765517+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_69c4bd976454c19c468d04bb04289baa443871dce5fefe4a9d7b7779dccc8126","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Dfn 3 of arXiv:2609.02974, 'Quilt decompositions of surfaces and Torelli group action on the extended Hatcher complex'] (quilt decompositions of a surface) [NS]

