  K^{-1}(w,b_{\ell x+i,0})=
  (-1)^{\ell x+i}\prod_{m=1}^i\alpha_m^{-1}\beta_m\\
 &\times\frac{1}{2\pi\i}\int_{\tilde \Gamma_s}\left(\left(\prod_{m=1}^{2i'+1}\phi_m(z_1)\right)^{-1}Q(z_1,w_1)\right)_{j'+1,1}
