        \begin{equation}
            \mu_{\mathbf a_i} \lt( \widehat{s}_{1}=\cdots=\widehat{s}_{m}=s_i|\widehat{\mathbf{a}}^m_i\rt) \leq C(\mu,m,\chi)(\lambda_{s_i})^{m(1-o_\chi(1))} N^{O(m\chi)}.
        \end{equation} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

