{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:38:13.636534+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6abf699f6ebb163ee7c62d58f5e7ad8701a3535aa38f818a05c0d14bcfb3c764","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 3 of arXiv:2609.00680, 'Sharp embeddings between quasi-Banach Besov spaces and shallow ReLU Variation spaces'] Let $X$ be a Banach space and let $\mathcal D\subset X$ be compact. The
