{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:22:21.883746+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6ac187b4ab393132e2d124016ce5e43865768ef8cc265c6614548ccad469290b","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:tau Psi of arXiv:2411.11345, 'Real Gaussian exponential sums via a real moment map'] We define the one form $\tau$ on $M$ given for all $x\in M$ by 
