{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:22:59.716871+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6af2d4bc8632f231b046a69f28d1543f81a8a2246e06c1463c982696e70869c7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:ik-partial-duality-2 of arXiv:2608.29708, 'Intuitionistic and Constructive Modal Logics for Classical Modal Logicians'] $\textbf{IK} \vdash \neg \Diamond \varphi \to \Box \neg \varphi$.
  \begin{proof}
