{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:21:45.269708+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6b0dfa069eee4beac7578cc198785ec0c4eae30f9eb09f2094c4ddcd0b94b1e7","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 6 of arXiv:2607.26944, 'Improved bounds on the inradius and inverse inradius process of the convex hull of planar '] Consider the exit time $\tau_{m,b}$ of the hourglass domain $\mathbb{H}_{m,b}$, as defined by~\eqref{eq:exit_time} and~\eqref{eq:hourglass}. Then for any $m>1$ and $b>0$, we have
