{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:37:20.368860+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6b1a64512dbd145c7ad7adaf0f6d512e38c9b4cfede7d2912a72d9abed238d3a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem_mlam of arXiv:2411.13419, 'Forest Fire Model on $\Z_{+}$ with Delays'] Suppose that $\Delta=0$ and $\theta>0$ is constant.
