{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:52:05.650773+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6ba90e5376ff970d5a4743bf616908eb7e1b3392083fb3cffe1ed59ee280a8b7","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop funct-ineq of arXiv:2602.06011, 'Excursion decomposition of the XOR-Ising model'] Let $\alpha\in(0,\sqrt{2})$.  
    \begin{enumerate}[label=(\roman*)]
