\end{equation} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:47:21.592937+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6bce419d71aeb4b646c62289c8144e9079b62e3a07766a2fcf1f735ebd764cff","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma E:3.2ui of arXiv:2412.08964, 'Phase transition and critical behavior in hierarchical\\integer-valued Gaussian and Coulom'] Given $n\ge1$, suppose that~$\{\fraktura c_k\}_{k=1}^{n+1}$ is related to a positive sequence
