{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:35:59.939505+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6bd27b9a93be1976c9084ad82254e3a24373f08ecfdcdb819e52cafce29bea2d","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 10 of arXiv:2608.26259, 'Cutoff with an $O(1)$ window for Potts Glauber Dynamics\\on lattice at High Temperature'] Assume \(0<\alpha\le(2C_{\mathrm{bp}})^{-1}\) and recall
\(\vartheta=C_{\mathrm{bp}}\alpha\). There are constants
