If moreover, in the case $\mathsf{s}=0$, $\int_{{\mathbb{R}}^\mathsf{d}}e^{-2\beta h_\mu}\,\mathop{}\!\mathrm d\mu<\infty$, then also
\begin{align}
\sup_{N\ge1}\ \sup_{0\le\eta\le\eta_0}\ {\mathbb{E}}_{\mu^{\otimes N}}\brak*{e^{-\frac{\beta}{2}W_{N,\eta}}}\le C_{\mathrm{cf}}(\beta,\mu)<\infty.
