{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:03:35.789180+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6c0c5bb843874aa48625931b5e1ecae8b342a618080b577fff623138a8817ad0","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:feature-side-localization of arXiv:2608.22910, 'A Commutator Framework for Selective Spectral Alignment in Deep Neural Networks'] For \(1\leq i,j\leq r_\ell\),
