{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:31:49.910657+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6c81685b1a93fb8df200a721e36cbd85732ba5ac0be3e83395287fea5091d1ec","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:trace-comparison of arXiv:2608.26745, 'Moderate Deviations for the Largest Eigenvalue of a Randomly Deformed Gaussian Unitary Ens'] There exist constants $c,C,c_*>0$ such that, whenever
