{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:53.186204+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6cf78bceb624286a9d912ec8bce7f8d48e56caf64ca9d8b3a6c3d9dd3e4f428e","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 10 of arXiv:2606.30364, 'Distributional comparison for non-commutative infinitely divisible probability measures'] Let $(\Ac,\varphi)$ be a $C^{\ast}$-probability space. 

