	$(ii)$ $S_{\epsilon}(t,\tau)=S_{\epsilon}(t,s)S_{\epsilon}(s,\tau)$ for any $t\geq s \geq \tau$;

	$(iii)$ $S_{\epsilon}(t,\tau): \mathcal{P}_{4,z}({H})\rightarrow \mathcal{P}_{4,z}({H})$ is continuous for any $t\geq \tau$.","status":"unverified"}

