{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:17:13.068620+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6d2969d00bddb650f9cccd8adf801c2302ba094edcd001c3da0c65d0f6702df9","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition $d$-admissible orientations of arXiv:2509.06273, 'Normalized Matching Property for Competing Urn Models'] For any nonnegative integer $d$, 
