{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:13:18.515583+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6d31d31e23de1cec0c5dead0ed73723a4cab1b248731ca3ad3e87d2a3c5f4c80","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 17 of arXiv:2608.30602, '2608.30602'] Let $r=|x-y|$, and let $\rho=|x-z|-|z-y|$, $\tau=\frac{2(|x-z|\,|z-y|)^{1/2}}{\sqrt{r^2-\rho^2}}$ and $u(\rho,\theta)$ be as in the proof of Lemma~\ref{lem:boundedness of W^V_0-2}. Then the kernel
