{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:01:25.575521+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6d3257c0bf58f2e27969a31b644464ff127c8b434796ebe42a21669d1c7cc71d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:on-dim_conv_SI_setting of arXiv:2605.15783, 'Set-indexed and multiple sums in high dimensions'] In the {\bf (SI)} setting suppose that (a)--(d) hold. Then, for every
