    \end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:20:55.706200+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6d407ef7ea230ad9057197c0557576acccf872271664f1de3adbcb5b180f4cca","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem: covariance bound of arXiv:2411.07840, 'Central limit theorem for the focusing $Φ^4$-measure in the infinite volume limit'] For $i=1,2$, we have 
\begin{equation}
G_{i,  x_0 }(x,y):=\mathbb{E}_{ \nu_{C_i^Q, x_0}^\perp }\Big[\phi(x)\overline \phi(y)\Big] \lesssim e^{-\mathrm{dist}(x-y, 2L^2\mathbb{Z})},
