{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:02:38.609623+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6d4c9ab7577f11aa556dbde44cc0e16818aada2c0bd869bc77704ba44ec31dfd","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thmx 2 (Lower soft edge limit, $\liminf a_n/n>0$, \cite{RRV}) of arXiv:2607.08536, 'Soft edge limit of the Laguerre beta-ensemble at the lower edge'] Assume $\liminf\limits_{n\to \infty} \frac{a_n}{n}>0$, and let $\Lambda_{n}\sim \mathrm{Laguerre}_{n,\beta,a_n}$. Then as $n\to \infty$, we have
