        \sup_D\left(\sum_{i=0}^{n-1} d(x_{t_i},x_{t_{i+1}})^{1/\alpha}\right)^\alpha \leq C|t-s|^{\alpha-1/q}|x|_{_{W^{\alpha,q};[s,t]}},
