{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:09:34.453995+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6dea3e42a898dc85dcbdecb96bf8956d58d8dbbbd03851b17eba80a160cb9b83","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem dimPKd of arXiv:2505.11721, 'Variational principles for Hausdorff and packing dimensions of fractal percolation on self'] Fix $\ell\in\mathscr L$. With probability~1, conditional on $\{K_\cdot\neq \emptyset\}$,  one has 
