{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:02:08.122305+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6e39b76a7a9938db0a79c189dce7f9285d1bc1b50cacd2cd24e6c3874ddcc407","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 18 of arXiv:2608.27433, 'Scalar curvature on K\"ahler blow-ups and systolic inequalities'] Let $\eps_i\to0$ and suppose
