{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:09:34.455091+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6e3ba17cd7bf57c8a710f78a55188a47ca50ecf8d991b94391b7707f89543fa4","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition SN' of arXiv:2505.11721, 'Variational principles for Hausdorff and packing dimensions of fractal percolation on self'] For all  $q\in (0,1]$, one has 
