{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:32:38.635309+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6ea5f0a26e437559d871b79f289c013ad79da9fba8586635bc867f838b0c7f43","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 6 of arXiv:2506.17109, 'Limit theorems under nonlinear expectations dominated by sublinear expectations'] Let $\{X_{i}\}_{i=1}^{\infty}$ be a sequence of $d$-dimensional
