        \item[(ii)] $\tilde{W}=\{\tilde{W}(t),\tilde{\mathscr{F}_t};0\leq t\leq \infty\}$ is cylindrical Wiener process on $\ell^{2}(\mathbb{Z}^+)$, $\tilde{X}=\{\tilde{X}(t),\tilde{\mathscr{F}_t};0\leq t\leq \infty\}$ is an adapted process in $\ell_\rho^{2}(\mathbb{Z}^+)$ and 
