{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:44:12.641910+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6efbee0ecb2e2a1217ff2a20bb75005ee5930376b6dfb69d2efe748e4e265796","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:gaussian-spatial-truncation of arXiv:2512.04371, 'Constructive Approximation under Carleman's Condition, \\ with Applications to Smoothed An'] Let $\mu$ be a probability measure on $\mathbb{R}^d$ satisfying that
