{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:59.500690+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6f41a6b8e7f8a3f9f6ba4e8ff7ad3513f7baf8ef53938d066933312c07c92ef2","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 29 of arXiv:2605.10150, 'Rough path theory and an introduction to rough partial differential equations'] For all $(Y,Y') \in \scrd_X^{2 \alpha}([0,T],\bar{W})$ we have
