{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:25:44.594330+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6f505873fa8c54dbedd129c69bd70c11641fe710b0a8a22db0eef0c2d731f53b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem spectral norm of arXiv:2509.15790, 'Covariance matrices of volume power functionals of random simplicial complexes -- an asymp'] The following statements hold for the spectralnorm $\| \cdot \|_2$: \
