{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:51:30.072905+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6f65fd72c4c2210ef18c63bce58ae15297668fc5254242a52a0c56dfdea3eeb5","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 32 of arXiv:2606.01832, 'MA(1) processes with uniform innovations conditioned to stay positive in the non-expanding'] In the orange region, for $0\leq m\leq p$ and $y\in A_m$, it holds
