{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:38:57.117120+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6f6a56b68c6f36e041c70ac463ca6fdfdbe5a9efcb7ab172f925fffec9527868","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 13 of arXiv:2604.04823, '2604.04823'] Fix~$\chi:[0,\infty) \to [0,1]$ be a smooth cutoff function satisfying
