{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:28:31.998881+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6f9f631be003dc05f5bd092ae8bca6bf1cf2fab632d921a1bfd016d70a22646c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 10 (Tube does not intersect barrier) of arXiv:2512.02661, 'Worst-case mixing estimates for Brownian motion with semipermeable barriers'] There exist absolute constants $\gamma_0,\delta_0 >0$ such that the following holds for every $\gamma \leq \gamma_0$ and $\delta \leq \delta_0$.
