{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:53:53.183974+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6ffbbd8146cad1fc939f3cb0ac4994761beeaaa5ccee796ca40b4f896a1fdc06","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 8 (Endpoint local exponent) of arXiv:2606.11758, '2606.11758'] For a nonnegative random variable \(W\) with \(\mathbb E W=1\), define
