{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:03:35.745273+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_70065e07717a94aa09441798d4903b9a31158386acb516e62106e3d9feb794ea","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop periodicAttractiveLowerBounds of arXiv:2609.02743, 'Sharp mean-field estimates for diffusive log/Riesz gases in the Hilbert--Schmidt regime'] Assume $\mathsf{d}\ge11$. Then:
