{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:17:13.063344+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7039e7eb785b44740c08df1dde6a16a8347997ca6391701930317e1a7f4b0ef0","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition eq:ingdef of arXiv:2508.04954, 'Conditional exponential directed last passage percolation under a one-point upper large de'] For ${\boldsymbol \sigma}, {\boldsymbol \tau}\in \mathcal S_{\mb{n}}$ and $L>0$, define the integral 
