{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:41:03.289046+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7070545f0cb1ee5b21decc7375f8e637c039afdcec51f08532cd6ed1a9cb7d12","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem hunt of arXiv:2411.08796, 'Optimal stopping for Markov processes \\ with positive jumps'] Consider a standard Markov process  $X$ without negative jumps. 
