{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:46:00.356735+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7074780e6ff729b392e5db02d47c12e8a1066aca20bcca762f94cfd48967646b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem th:um:aniso of arXiv:2607.20956, 'Sharp moduli of continuity for Gaussian fields and stochastic PDEs via correlation bounds'] Under Assumptions (a:sigma:aniso of the paper) and (a:psi:aniso of the paper),
