{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:32:58.377122+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7076b421493fc8f4cdcc8e2b3af393b41509e585a8491f12f3a524a4e17f91e3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:E''-bnd of arXiv:2506.06559, 'Bi-infinite incipient cluster in high dimensions'] We have
