{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:21:52.420112+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_707b5e39f0c061ebc501fdd0eddaa3cf289b1679850f1bc6dc4daff7450c71da","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 126 of arXiv:2601.16377, '2601.16377'] We have as $\N \rightarrow \infty$
