{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:02:28.587610+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_70cc2881e9c1a8451ad66ea01f911530fbf98f69fb536d4dd65dc269091a52b7","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 4 of arXiv:2609.01346, '2609.01346'] If $(x,r,\theta)$ solves \eqref{eq:profile-system} on $[0,L]$, where
