{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:57:20.591214+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_70de0b1017b0e554493927dee8ca9eb290b6faefabdacc522810e50d5cfab09c","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm_brownrec of arXiv:2411.09976, 'Occupation times on the legs of a diffusion spider'] Let  $\mathbf{X}$ be a Brownian spider and let $A_1^{(i)}$ be the occupation time on leg~$L_i$ up to time~1. 
