		\big| F^{(t)}(z_1) -F^{(t)}(z_2) \big| \leq C(\omega) \Bigg( \frac{\big| z_1-z_2 \big| }{d} \Bigg) \max_{z\in B(u,d)} \big| F^{(t)}(z) \big|.
