{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:12:20.553883+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_712581cda835a83129d76d8fadabcbc522e7ac6aab18d2657c86e3454a1278b4","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma measure_tau2_u_v of arXiv:2603.28936, 'Composition of random functions and word reconstruction'] Let $(\tau,\tau';v,v') \in \mathfrak{P}^{i,j,\ell}$. 
