    }
 Then there is a constant $\widehat C$ depending only on $\widetilde C$ such that
    \begin{align*}
        \mathbb{E} \left[ X^4 \right] \leq \widehat C \bclr{\mathbb{E}[X]+\mathbb{E}[X]^4}.

    \end{align*}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:54:18.237215+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_71b234e1b0303a9fabb1f74ec018e64910958bd9b0dff068d6d27e8927276135","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem-Phi-Aij of arXiv:2608.29147, 'The crossing matrix and the Burau matrix of pure braids'] For the hook generator $A_{ij} \in P_m$ ($1 \leq i<j \leq m$), we have 
