{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:18:19.216920+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_71c77a6acf0ed693edfc90979a062fb5381e54d045cdc0e6affb08982653faad","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 11 of arXiv:2608.29075, 'The 2-Monoidal Structure of Symmetric Sequences'] [\cite{Operads_2013_Hess}] 
