{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:43:18.952684+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_71e7c738c4f302119ac685ba4511a4671e4c202d92cf6b83e527cdcef17f110b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma smalls of arXiv:2609.02541, 'A note on the norm of the embedding of $\text{PW}^2$ into $\text{PW}^q$'] As $s\to 0^{+}$, we have
