for any fixed $L>0$ and all $f\in \Lipbar{\mathbb{R}, L}(\mathbb{S})$. Moreover $U_1^{\mathrm{RR}}\in \mathbb{D}_{\mathbb{R}_+}[0,\infty)$ is a non-decreasing function with $U_1^{\mathrm{RR}}(0)=0$ and satisfies
