{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:38:37.402983+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_72379efc34757190781f8ee864ce462011c57286b9468246d6d4c70bae79f065","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 13 of arXiv:2605.15386, 'The non-central gamma sum and difference distributions: exact distribution and asymptotic '] Let $n$ be a non-negative integer and let $b\in\mathbb{R}$ and $x\in\mathbb{R}$. Then
