{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:31:49.847717+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_725175c41e3605d7eeb1cff2a5eb887bbe8d7be79c4ddd773d4424782f49415e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem: mass growth rate of arXiv:2608.23756, 'Measure-valued fluid limits for partial service queues\\with correlated patience and servi'] If $\boldsymbol{\mu} \in \mathcal{S}^+$, then we have:
