{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:58:40.872467+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_72b21616af290c8a983d59a0df1f50a2c46381733a31afe1ea3b1eab6eb104ca","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma segers2022:lemma4.1 of arXiv:2605.10491, 'Zero-couplings of infinite measures with cyclically monotone support and multivariate regu'] \mbox{}


