{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:05:28.253024+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7327100ec6609bc450586d98a0a3cd70f62048925ed30f3d27a40a0e1caa685e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma convergence of the truncated partition function with general G of arXiv:2602.04429, 'Disordered systems and (subcritical) polynomial chaos\\ with heavy-tail disorder'] {}
