{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:31:14.335989+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7357881ae4f69b7c3abd67b56ea4098ebe488174c2d572dc6b8fe5e907d5a60c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma T_prop_lemma_eq of arXiv:2606.17425, 'Order statistics for edge eigenvectors of Wigner matrices'] For any $k \geq 1$, $\mathring{V}$ satisfies the following properties \begin{equation}
