{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:51:11.972148+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_73e439b8a5bd2dcad7600270cb56042144a6960121f0b2c5e0c35d9495141f87","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 32 (Valuation exchange and Rees saturation) of arXiv:2608.08756, 'Infinite-Dimensional L\'evy Area and Spectral Ancestry'] For a filtered response $\mathcal R:M^*\to\mathcal Y$, the following are
equivalent.
\begin{enumerate}[label=\textup{(\roman*)},leftmargin=2.8em]
