{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:49:05.448250+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_73f66480469415965dc6ff3086a5e51df6c40997338778aa902502e4e4700739","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Deff occ-meas of arXiv:2601.19145, 'Stochastic Persistence in Infinite Dimensions'] For any $x \in \mathcal{M}$ and $t > 0$ let $\mu_t^x$ denote the empirical occupation measure 
