{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:38:58.727047+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7415ae2268855413e488d994a8baa9d7c9b30ca126a3dccfc39cf50edee59b6e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma IVNox of arXiv:2511.06321, 'Torus scaling limits and the plateau of the critical weakly coupled $|\varphi|^4$ model in'] Assuming (equation asmp:obsRG of the paper),  as $N\rightarrow \infty$,
