{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:43:19.188065+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7439a95a0afea6b49a77be6314c4245fd2faeb9ce0ee8a134580705faf351d89","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma4.2 of arXiv:2609.02607, 'Spatial inhomogeneity for a three-dimensional doubly degenerate nutrient system with indir'] Let $K>0$ with the property that (equation 1.6 of the paper) holds. Given
