{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:38:08.478933+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7467b4444a55b2bc91a848b61241318ec53a4c94de618a743bb128f40dc653a1","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:unknown-class-prior:auc of arXiv:2609.02304, 'Bayes-Optimal BER and AUC: \\Estimation and Evaluation of Estimators'] For any $\theta' \in (0, 1)$,
