    \mathbb E[\exp(h_\mathbf{u}(X_T))]=\exp(h_{\bm{\psi}(T)})(x_0).
\end{align} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:54:57.600042+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_74e8d4303a5b112f22dda6a4b978b1a9104659bda02f6129cc88b43581566bfe","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:estimate of arXiv:2412.03450, 'On intermediate levels of nested occupancy scheme in random environment generated by stick'] Suppose (equation eq:estim of the paper). Then
