{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:41:11.652589+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_74ff9e2a42610c11cc610dee07293ab1bd65e8516adfebc1d67f9cea2df1a191","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop prop_invariant_measure_slowman_2016 of arXiv:2411.13964, 'Long-time analysis of a pair of on-lattice and continuous run-and-tumble particles with ja'] The invariant
