{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:57:28.220406+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_752b6b8e46e88334f389e8d164bfdcc3d84b4ae8cb7a6ab7004022d9c7ca381e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 6 (Successive strict enlargements) of arXiv:2607.17630, 'Higher-Order Hankel Obstructions to Free Infinite Divisibility\ for Beta Distributions'] Fix $p=7/10$.  For $2\leq N\leq11$, let $q_N$ be given in
