{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:31:14.339816+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_75b994f8f654135acc729a4747bd13c321d23b1804d7bc818638bb0b344c44ca","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemAiry: c_1 small difference of arXiv:2606.19207, 'Extrema of cooling branching Brownian motion and related Gaussian fields'] Suppose that $c$ solves (equation eqAiry: dc/ds ODE of the paper) on $[s_0,s_1]$. Then, for $s\in[s_0,s_1]$,
