{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:07:15.754848+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_760a64a2727da94c6811b62b72ec5c015a472c6b39b19091b670a701c0aba603","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:abstract-gaussian-disintegration of arXiv:2608.02459, 'Response Calculus for Spectral Simplicity\\ and Joint Eigenvalue Densities'] With $t$ and $x^\perp$ defined in
