{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:59:24.055361+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_762a58874d0b492d002c730001f8d4f836e55725680642a425052db91f723461","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:multiplier-estimate of arXiv:2608.30904, 'Entire monotone solutions of the anisotropic Allen--Cahn equation in dimension 5'] The multiplier satisfies
