{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:46:25.364326+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_762d8a403737970acbb87cacfe415f1c12e1d9c2902a7d053c59c9041280d7ca","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem property:distance-points of arXiv:2604.14122, 'The scaling limit of random walk and\\ the intrinsic metric on planar critical percolation'] Assume that the event $F$ holds. Then
