{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:46:00.324396+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_76ee83e4caa8f2e7fbafbf44ee7363ec2635dfc1d2eb81e59d81fef38590886c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:one-arm-fubini of arXiv:2607.18070, 'The Brownian loop-catcher'] For every nonnegative Borel functional \(g\) on loops surrounding \(z\),
