{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:56:03.899405+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_77082fb19322920d3b7c41889057ff521a0dc7454b197eb73ca4e7f54c2e0cf5","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 12 (UPDF) of arXiv:2606.20169, 'THEORY OF UNCERTAIN PROBABILITY:\\ CAN WE DERIVE THE PROBABILITY DENSITY FUNCTION OF UNCER'] Hence, we have
\begin{equation}
\begin{aligned}
