{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:28:31.995041+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_770fe325f7efb9f727e559e60f8d19abe993023a9525cfa4c0c2917ff5ff2588","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 34 of arXiv:2512.02286, 'Pfaffian Transition Probability and Correlation Kernel of TASEP in Half-space'] Let $N\geq M\geq 1$ be fixed integers and let $y=(y_1,\dots,y_M)$ be a half-space configuration. Then, the function \eqref{eq:F initial coord function} has the following alternative expression:
	\begin{multline}

