{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:48:24.299721+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_77108b0fb2f35d62e60655c7e7748cc94752f60c85918a7a632cf15c38761e54","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:IPS:noise:contraction of arXiv:2605.16904, 'Positive-rate PCA and IPS with stationary Bernoulli measures are rapidly forgetful \footno'] Let $(\Theta_J)_{J\Subset\mathbb{Z}^d}$ be the family of asynchronous updating kernels associated with memoryless noise
