{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:09:59.188472+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_771713ad1bacaee5d69633f0843fa8fa4063d141ac45bf328fa74524903d0d8e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition lem:non-crossing-BB of arXiv:2608.05262, 'The law of $(1+1)$D SOS with an area tilt in a wedge'] For $\mathfrak h > \theta_\star$, $\lambda>1$ and $A$ of (def:A of the paper),  
