{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:38:08.488899+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7718c822e3bc0d630870e0c1f19b6c7af32429b9d1d38843f2c75ce6a2de4c26","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:gaussian of arXiv:2609.02304, 'Bayes-Optimal BER and AUC: \\Estimation and Evaluation of Estimators'] Under the shared-covariance Gaussian mixture model described above,
