{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:09.070454+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7725a96d78df6a7c60950a3bd6eb33d529c36713a0534356c598de77125ca93e","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 2 (Moment duality) of arXiv:2606.28174, 'Moment duality and propagation of exchangeability'] Assuming L is label-forgetful, the forward and backward processes are moment dual: \begin{equation}

