{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:33:17.673748+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_776c616aa14b959326c64caae5d07b05460f927fa9cc3c1d25fa399b8fb03eef","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 6 (Weighted vector Bochner identity) of arXiv:2607.10769, '\fontsize{14}{17}\selectfont\bfseries Sharp Poincar\'e interpolation along Wasserstein geo'] For every $X\in C_c^\infty(\R^n;\R^n)$,
