{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:57:51.748138+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_77dab096144150d739f7c8e0a65361418f54f04bd9eb428798fd113bfce751df","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 14 of arXiv:2608.30138, 'High-frequency wave propagation for the viscoelastic wave equation with singular memory'] Let $k\ge 1$. Define
