\leq C_0 \mathcal{L}_Q^{\#},
\end{equation}
where $\mathcal{L}_Q^{\#}$ is as in (equation eq:def_En_Q of the paper) and $Q=I\times B$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:34:45.615485+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_77ef52d87611bdb0ee778edf97280071cf3a8bf9703d15e05395a91bd0ec37a6","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem n covering of arXiv:2609.01791, 'Minimum $b_2$ of symplectic fillings of lens spaces'] Let $\textbf{n}$ be obtained from $(0)$ through a sequence of strict blowup, with at least one of those strict blowups being a middle blowup. Then, $adjusted(\textbf{n})$ covers at least one of the following:
