for all density $f$ with respect to $\nu^N$ and $N> 4\ell$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:28.477077+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_77fc5993f7543a39671ae2b8d563f2dd289631887a4e8c6625933286d1f351cd","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 86 (Finite-increment Pfaffian identity) of arXiv:2606.29292, 'Intrinsic Gaussian Tensor Geometry and Random Operator Spectra'] For an ordered finite family $d_1,\ldots,d_m\in E$ put
