        N(4L_1^{\theta},...,4L_1^{\theta};L_1^{-k+(k-1)\theta} \lambda_{s_{1}}\cdots \lambda_{s_{k-1}})\gg_n L_1^{\theta(k-1)n -2^{k-1}\delta} 
