{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:22:20.961967+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_78909bb64d92cfdea2b415cf537dd54e33bc218d1cb8cc60b9d4ef9a29a588c9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 7 of arXiv:2605.28776, 'Limiting distributions of triangle counts in linear preferential attachment models'] For $m\ge 2$ and $\delta>-m$. Then
