{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:32:18.841456+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_789d2acee49da65723eaf50c83db339ca376678f46acc9dc8126bdafb828b0f7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 17 of arXiv:2609.03831, 'On flows generated by square-integrable vector fields'] Let $\Bi \in \boldsymbol{L}^1_\loc(I\times \R^d \times \R)$
