{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:10:07.263963+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_78f1acedeb6f91936ed40b159bd62107ab526476a48ef0e29f878c8eff2031e0","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:piunif of arXiv:2603.05467, 'Thresholds for colouring the random Borsuk graph'] Let $U \hspace{.2ex} \raisebox{-.1ex}{$=$} \hspace{-1.5ex} 
\raisebox{1ex}{{$\scriptstyle d$}} \hspace{.8ex}  \text{Unif}(S^d)$ and $Z := \pi(U)$.
