The positive constant $C_3$ was introduced in Lemma (lem: Key Lemma of the paper). (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:12:13.585767+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_79081e6ec9648f4c788f13f05383f5e062f1fb158c7708998d346e535cc2fa71","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 45 (Well-definedness and regularity of the Stein witness) of arXiv:2608.28827, 'Quantitative Target Convergence and Uniform-in-Time\\ Propagation of Chaos for Langevin-Re'] Under Assumption~\ref{ass:core-target} and either kernel assumption,
\(\mathcal H^d\) is separable, the map
