{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:28.469769+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_798626dde50aa8b70ead7511dbe845b7361ab3462dcc4d80f7f47bb01585a9ca","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 24 (Completed decoupled chaos map) of arXiv:2606.29292, 'Intrinsic Gaussian Tensor Geometry and Random Operator Spectra'] Fix $p\ge2$ and $2\le r<\infty$.  The algebraic map
