{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:38:13.637129+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_79c67d82e9da9eba5b60ebb62384c288641149a26fc4d83deb622a2e2cf1ea47","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 8 of arXiv:2609.00680, 'Sharp embeddings between quasi-Banach Besov spaces and shallow ReLU Variation spaces'] Let $0<p\le 1$, $0<q\le\infty$, and $s>0$. Suppose that
