{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:53:11.421516+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_79d40a7c3e495cc4a356a53c03e5fd27a4590678eb8262bdf9a68639e40868de","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 11 of arXiv:2606.09121, 'Truncated Signature Information for Mixed Fractional Brownian Paths'] Let $\alpha_1,\ldots,\alpha_K$ be distinct real numbers and let $a_r,b_r\in\mathbb R$.  If
