\end{equation*}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:21:06.883102+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7a74a08502c7263d7f86bb77e3604a3ff032aae51d69f92f19117fad883ed82d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 9 of arXiv:2608.21312, 'Interface between competing random walks on a cycle'] In the situation of Theorem~\ref{thm:ATDwalk}, there is a universal constant $c>0$ 
