{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:33:17.732241+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7a92f50241cc28e743cfead51c72d1506f00648f0ef1d1d707cdab7e7d23c410","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 87 (Uniform fixed-point estimate) of arXiv:2607.10813, '2607.10813'] Let $\mathfrak K$ satisfy Definition~\ref{def:localized-smallness-class}
