{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:03:39.774272+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7b2721df360d88a593b6ac3ddafc903bfca708c13dd6a901f71adaeb8607e5e7","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:expr-after-shuffling of arXiv:2411.03065, 'Growing conditioned BGW trees with\\ log-concave offspring distributions'] Let $T\in\trees$.
	For every $\mathtt{u}\inT$, we have
