for any $m\ge2$. Moreover, the solution depends continuously on the initial data $v_0\in L_\sigma^2(\IR^2)\cap H^\sigma(\IR^2)$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

