{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:59:25.055173+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7b40b6797b954456cde3a88c946da181d1e57064770bb8d6f5f5a3fd274ae7b0","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 8 of arXiv:2607.01629, 'Quadratic fluctuations of speed-change Kawasaki dynamics'] For every test function $f$, the sequence of martingales and the corresponding quadratic variation  
