{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:38:11.738328+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7b62762976ff9ceddfd1cb3210f19bc9f05e1b594d7ce693d54be99827f4b270","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:fourthcumu1 of arXiv:2504.00512, 'Localization-delocalization transition for a random block matrix model at the edge'] In the setting of (lemma_G_large_2 of the paper), we have that     
