{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:11:11.683733+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7b7019800cffc3b72c31687cd3e6c3773cb9b1873df5514092f9f10ae0085891","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:marked-cylinder-count of arXiv:2609.00560, 'Distribution of Kaneko's val function'] For every $\epsilon\in\mathbb{Z}/2\mathbb{Z}$, every finite word $\mathbf b$, and every $L>0$,
