{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:50:36.750520+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7b813a0646dcaa66494ac86dba06f54fb9398a36a1e7150b7a859e42708d52ea","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 3 (Zeldovich's anti-dynamo theorem
\cite{Zeldovich_1992}) of arXiv:2609.04153, '\vspace*{-3cm}Smooth autonomous fast dynamo action on the three-torus'] Let $\eps>0$ and let $u\in C^\infty_\sigma(\TT^2)$. Consider
