{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:43:53.586894+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7c5a3a5f32596ce4a58b7cc9ad3b385cfafeeab2140f761166c01e6f93947912","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem vestimate1 of arXiv:2512.12902, 'Non-equilibrium fluctuations for the \\stirring process with births and deaths'] \cite [Theorem 2.1] {de2012truncated}
