{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:19:00.873798+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7c772c46c6e95ec70582d95abbb25f6261b6e0244d90b0567fe17c1c8954e56e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 27 (The anticipation martingale) of arXiv:2608.20337, 'Information on trajectories:\\ martingales and random times'] For the survival and hazard of~\eqref{eq:surv-haz} and the hazard clock and martingale factor of~\eqref{eq:clock-mart}, the processes $\clock{\tau}$ and $\Amart{\tau}$ satisfy:
