{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:54:15.714172+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7c7f5dd731cbb0c819169251f57e071ecd9577ff0776dda3520f965ddc05e447","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 12 of arXiv:2608.09840, 'Langevin dynamics along the zero set of real-analytic potentials'] Let $D \subset \R^d$ be an open domain, and let $X \subset D$ be a subanalytic set closed in $D$ with a subanalytic Whitney stratification $\Scal$ that satisfies the frontier condition.
We then have:
\begin{enumerate}
