{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:48:45.321632+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7c84abae3ea4c1862ff53c73b7879e9ca51094836ffe826fe582369f4a09c824","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem t:BendikovSaloffCoste of arXiv:2411.14936, 'Massive Particle Systems,\\Wasserstein Brownian Motions,\\ and the Dean--Kawasaki Equation'] The quadratic form~$(\boldsymbol\mssE,\Cyl{}{})$ on~$L^2(\boldsymbol\nu)$ defined by
