Its closure~$\big({\boldsymbol\mssE,\msD(\boldsymbol\mssE)}\big)$ is a quadratic form on~$L^2(\boldsymbol\nu)$ with generator the $L^2(\boldsymbol\nu)$-Friedrichs extension~$\big({\boldsymbol\mssL,\msD(\boldsymbol\mssL)}\big)$ of~$(\boldsymbol\mssL,\Cyl{}{})$.

Further define the following assumptions:
