{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:33:23.321263+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7ca9bfacc4c36fbdd4a56a889f2e4fc9771bda96816becf83f03a02a01b5aabb","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 15 of arXiv:2506.21087, 'Quasi-Stationary Distributions of Interacting Dynamical Systems and their approximation'] Assume \ref{condhzero} and \ref{condhun} and that,
