{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:52:17.578750+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7d25924d4d04f10b84f8db605a6a55e05e6f2f568584126eebb992573fc43960","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary c:RepulsivePhiDomLoc of arXiv:2411.14936, 'Massive Particle Systems,\\Wasserstein Brownian Motions,\\ and the Dean--Kawasaki Equation'] Let~$\sigma$ be a regular pair potential.
