{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:38:23.614355+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7d3da4108d368838d3c6dd41ab3481e4344224365dc1d315ba860200810f7bb8","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma EHI:l:m2lambdaComparable of arXiv:2511.08956, '\textbf{Towards a characterization of elliptic Harnack inequality for jump processes}'] Let $X$ be an isotropic unimodal L\'{e}vy jump process. For all $r_0>0$, we have
