{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:04:40.965529+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7e168efbcf0bc8a6cefb060e985b8bbcc5aced2a78ece7a86e523a8dd41f526a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop LyapTorus of arXiv:2412.03560, 'Non-asymptotic entropic bounds for non-linear kinetic Langevin sampler with second-order s'] Assume that $\mathbb X=\mathbb T^d$ and 
    \begin{equation}

    \|D F\|_\infty = \sup_{\mu\in\mathcal P_2(\mathbb T^d)} \sup_{x\in\mathbb T^d} |DF(\mu,x)| < \infty\,, \end{equation}
