{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:56:00.657307+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7e2ac2a24608d32db5018b49dc47513e5fc292ab1135566d0ccc0cf849c8dc91","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma_X_shift of arXiv:2603.29442, 'A compact support property for infinite-dimensional SDEs with Hölder continuous coefficien'] For all $\zeta>0$ and $\delta>0$, for any $\mathbb{P} \in \mathscr{M}_{\gamma,\delta}$, $k \in \mathbb{N}_0$ and $r \geq 0$,
