		 t^{-{\gamma}}\mbox{\bf 1}_{\{\frac{d}{2}\frac{q+1}{q}<p<\frac{q-1}{2}\}}+t^{-\frac{{2\gamma}(q-p)}{q+1}}\mbox{\bf 1}_{\{\frac{q-1}{2}<p<q\}}	&\mbox{if  $\,p>\frac{d}{2}(1+\frac 1q)$,}








