{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:37:51.456818+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7eaaeb890df2558a3de7feb4474989aa8847e5bcc9949e383b0660d4526a3c5e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 21 of arXiv:2604.03777, 'Equilibrium fluctuations for a multi-species particle system with long jumps'] Let $\gamma >0$, $0 \leq s \leq t \leq T$ and $n \in \mathbb{N}_+$. Then
\begin{align*}  
&\mathbb{E}_{\nu_{\rho}} \Bigg[ \Bigg\{ \frac{\Theta(n) K_n}{\sqrt{n}}  \int_s^t \dd r \sum_x \sum_{y =x + n}^{\infty} [  H ( \tfrac{y - r v_n }{n}  ) - H ( \tfrac{x - r v_n }{n}  )  ] a(y-x)   \bar{\xi} _x^{\alpha}( \eta_r^n ) \bar{\xi} _y^{\beta}( \eta_r^n ) \Bigg\}^{2} \Bigg] \leq  \widehat{C}  (t-s)^{2}\frac{ [ \Theta(n) K_n ]^{2} }{n^{2 \gamma+1}}. 
