{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:23:27.796693+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7ec0cad7c8d59932bf3497f36810554868612164898ce84160835cb1728a9d51","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm t.generalgmc of arXiv:2606.11043, 'Thick points under Gaussian free field dynamics'] Let $h$ be a Gaussian, such that the following hypotheses are fulfiled 
    \begin{enumerate}
