{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:47:07.715988+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7ed1b2bb27d31002a2e98e431d2627e288013c74c312253741856be89c3131c9","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 7 (Bounded realizations of tangent balls) of arXiv:2608.06393, 'Intrinsic Tangential Hadamard Differentiability of Rough-BSDE Solution Maps'] Fix $\mathbf x\in WG\Omega_p(E)$ and $R<\infty$. There is a constant
