{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:43:19.187408+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7edfeebe6575f568ccc80b5739ee3194c403b183738ab147482c22742584aa35","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma3.9 of arXiv:2609.02607, 'Spatial inhomogeneity for a three-dimensional doubly degenerate nutrient system with indir'] ([WinklerEven])
