{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:21:10.895181+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7f477308ddd52c60ffa398c589119305abb29ea96da7e3bdfa4d546d53627c94","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 32 of arXiv:2508.04938, 'Perfect t-embeddings of doubly periodic Aztec diamonds'] For non-boundary dual vertices~$(2\ell x,2y)$ in~$(A_{\ell N}')^*$ and two functions~$f$ and~$g$, set
