{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:19:06.741815+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7f675b8e186dbc1851f63edcce325424d602b9238f598437da190c9f0c0a28cb","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem limit_MGF of arXiv:2606.02340, 'Transitivity in Inhomogeneous Random Tournaments'] Suppose $W$ is a $\triangle$-regular tournamenton and $X$ be as defined in (equation eq:TnJpf of the paper). Denote by $M_X(t) := \mathbb{E}[e^{t X}]$ the moment generating function of $X$. Then, for all $|t|<\frac{1}{4}$, 
