{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:37:25.876816+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7f7aa5e34c74cbbac4f4cd7e704969a2a09f22d5aa89965c1fbe19b72b4c6216","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 14 of arXiv:2608.29501, 'Disorder Thresholds and Free Energy of Brownian Directed Polymers with\\ Product and Radia'] In the present Brownian polymer model,
