{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:37:09.017880+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7f88d614a864800a459bf7213432a949289cf9999a1d77694153d3008b76ec81","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:h1_tail of arXiv:2609.01697, 'Unique ergodicity of projective cocycles over the 2D stochastic Navier--Stokes equations'] In the setting of Lemma~(lem:shell_approximation of the paper)
