{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:24:20.981476+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7fe461c228f0a4edea8ebe16c5c52afa5e3ab12cc2912931d3a4eb2e31974490","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:good_scales_intermediate of arXiv:2508.18809, '{\bf Critical long-range percolation III: The upper critical dimension}'] If $\alpha \leq d/3$ then there exist positive constants $c$ and $C$ such that
the set 
