{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:22:20.966231+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7ffdb3137f3f7daec289fc91815ced281274863b6e5223174bf3168f756dabb2","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 25 of arXiv:2607.28614, 'Tampered Memory Elephant Random Walk on one-dimensional integer lattice'] Let $\br_{ \mu{n}}$ be the error as in \eqref{Eq: error_vector}. Then, as $n \to \infty$, 
