{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:39:12.168429+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8038321a4a60cb7ee83ae1fc39d360c30371f92368bffc20c47b6b65a7ca112e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor_g_Mallows of arXiv:2412.07258, 'Permuton limit of a generalization of the Mallows and $k$-card-minimum models'] For any $\beta \in \mathbb{R}$
