{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:38:58.733301+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_80acbce95631f0e894d1a6501a5b19d674d01188e4cb7cad1f3ffd65f05ee2a0","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma fracLapGreen of arXiv:2511.06321, 'Torus scaling limits and the plateau of the critical weakly coupled $|\varphi|^4$ model in'] [MS22asymptotic] 

