{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:41:33.834159+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_80d4a026c659bc51953cfc3f60c3aa4c931f4c6922aed419393803017f19a1fb","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 43 (Kernel alignment under the factorized LAN hypothesis) of arXiv:2604.10792, 'Variable-Length Markov Chains on Finite Quivers: Boundary-Window Identifiability, Exact De'] Assume \cref{ass:lan}. Then
