{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:32:11.131495+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_80deee8be7153ee3c9c7ae1b4c67488586ab072d9f33f410ccf65d92806dcb00","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma0 of arXiv:2510.10898, 'A central limit theorem for unbalanced step-reinforced random walks'] For any $\beta\in (0,4]$, we have
