\item[(iv)] Order closure preserves norm bounded sets;
\item[(iv')] Uo closure preserves norm bounded sets.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:59:24.047360+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_80f0ee1bf312685d22661056c67dfb66a2bc6e47da026eff79d9bcf9e69a3bbc","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:effective-avr of arXiv:2608.30779, 'Some uniform estimates for K\"ahler--Ricci Shrinkers'] Let \((X^n,\omega,J,f,p)\) be a  K\"ahler--Ricci
