{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:53.192955+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_81101c605e2e181461fe51302a3dc82dff9ea0bc5b80997e9c449ee069270ceb","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 15 of arXiv:2606.31455, 'Discrete time-multidimensional renewal theory and applications'] For each coordinate $u=1,\ldots,d$,

\begin{equation*}
