{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:16:46.769810+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8184de1751f01be3fa27a8e7b3edab29fc2f082a6cbb863c4aebb802077ef1e0","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop First-Prop-Res of arXiv:2411.19543, 'Feller property and convergence for semigroups of time-changed processes'] \begin{enumerate}
