{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:47:22.250859+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8185391de41e1b59fde587f1d68ee8657e931ad347d43b083a897b50b8f778b3","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 56 of arXiv:2605.26664, 'Mixing times for Glauber dynamics of lozenge tilings of the hexagon'] We have for each $j \in [0, \mathfrak{j}]$ and $i \in [0, a_j-1]$ that 
