{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:07:15.776054+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_81aabc7b903691f4b79715b59e24a6156f84af13975df14b783232a06b242adb","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:BG of arXiv:2608.05089, 'Correlation decay in area-tilted line ensembles'] A line ensemble $\mathbf{X} : \mathbb{R} \to \mathbb{A}_+^\infty$ satisfies the $\lambda$-BG property if
