{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:38:04.519239+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_81ba3caa23ee841cc0435d44af85682333f5f720461e38cedcfc5a2779103225","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem eq:cluster-lower-bound-alt of arXiv:2607.18011, 'From local giants to locality in long-range percolation'] \thlabel{thm:cluster_size_lower_bound}
