where $\mathrm{d}{\mathbf u}= \mathrm{d} u_1\cdots\mathrm{d} u_m$  with each $u_i\in\Gamma_i$, and $\mathbb{B}^{\mathrm{br}}$ is a standard Brownian bridge.","status":"unverified"}

