{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:47:21.728854+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_81dcc4d4c2f6e6157108c7ca1bf0591a8e54803d54fcbdbd18d3dc779a34625d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:mom-cum of arXiv:2412.09290, 'Asymptotics of Harish-Chandra transform and infinitesimal freeness'] Let $\ensuremath{\boldsymbol{\mu}}$ be a probability measure on $\mathbb{R}$ such that it's
