{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:12:46.896030+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_827337d7709f8d52be5fb57ed7e6d1a3c73a83171a2be3c42b8244a261a20483","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition fixconti of arXiv:2608.09856, '\bf Mass erasure on measured $\bbR$-trees,\\ applications to L\'evy forests'] Let $(T, d, \rho)$ be a Polish $\mathbb{R}$-tree. Let $\mu, \mu_n\! \in \!  \mathcal{M}_f (T)$ and 
