{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:15:34.384907+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8274f0b03613cd761a3c823d5d687c940bc65a3a6453d42c258a3ea94535c356","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 16 of arXiv:2609.03248, 'Connections between colored restricted $b$-ary and ordinary partitions'] Let $b\geq 2$ and $\rho\geq 1$ be integers, and let $Z$ and $C_b^\rho(n;Z)$ be 
