{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:55.646914+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_82757ea47c0933b85b876f72c430d956b020357951bc12033e91686756bb5d48","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 38 (Uniform moments for the \texorpdfstring{\eqref{eq:kTULA}}{kTULA} scheme) of arXiv:2605.24937, '2605.24937'] Let Assumptions~\hyperref[ass:PJG]{(A1)}--\hyperref[ass:D]{(A4)} hold.
