\end{enumerate}
Then $\mathcal{NH}^s_n$ has measure zero.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:00:22.666387+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_829a5d6204c87e237ccf694d5ac3e9dc8bea0b8d9473df8cd0a45b732fc8dadb","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eq:2s5c-asymptotic-bar of arXiv:2411.00930, '\bf \Large Asymptotic Product-form Steady-state for Multiclass Queueing Networks: A Reentr'] For $\theta\in\mathbb{R}_-^5$ satisfying $|\theta(r)|\leq cr$, we have
