{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:54:57.590804+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8316e3da084db1a08d4169a28416b2db3d0329e1effbcedcc50baf81e870ce95","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop pro:limit_thm_2.2 of arXiv:2412.03370, 'TASEP with a general initial condition and a deterministically moving wall'] Recall $\tilde{x}_n(0)=x_n^f$ and suppose $\{x_n^f, n \in \mathbb{N}\}$ fulfils Assumption~(assumpt:2.9 of the paper). Then, it holds 
