{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:57:44.954059+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_83524a4318cc307ebb8ea71ee56d171053def279a2075acfe3b4cc6e671983d5","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 5 of arXiv:2606.25494, 'A functional central limit theorem for kernel gradient flow and infinitesimal gradient boo'] In addition to Assumptions~\ref{ass:loss} and~\ref{ass:kernel},
  assume that
