{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:40:27.000048+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_838033b04f0cc70d2598d428496812682c49d1e8e817c904b24ea24aa07719c6","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:sigma_ell_identity of arXiv:2604.17253, 'Large Deviations for the Nonlinear Schrödinger Equation with Randomized Quasi-Periodic Ini'] For all $k\ge1$, we have
