{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:04:30.611842+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8399438dd98a78803192f14749f86ef172a0cbf9369c11c433858450f55fe5dd","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem Ehat-bound of arXiv:2411.10586, 'A convergence framework for Airy$_\beta$ line ensemble\\ via pole evolution'] For \(w,w'\in\mathbb C\setminus {\mathbb R}\),
