{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:49:02.088302+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_83a16bfca725636d24aac90854e9e36262302107b8ffeb520a3a609f5337f754","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 3 (Hook-length formula) of arXiv:2604.25877, 'Asymptotic height of Plancherel random trees'] For a rooted tree $t \in \tym(n)$, the number of standard labellings is given by
