{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:50:44.869110+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_83a741540e7d3480fda2b45122e798812afbeaa1ebf1eef3143342a0ae16b8be","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 2 (The Hilbert endpoint) of arXiv:2607.16724, 'Algebraic Transfer for Operator-Valued Gaussian Chaoses: Oriented Schatten Profiles and Si'] For every $S\subset[m]$,
