{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:18:19.436538+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_854857e9e9374570a9d4525c9e78bc0ee3168c5bed0a7bacc8f28aa2a0beef78","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:twoPoint of arXiv:2508.09291, '1+O(1) asymptotics for loop percolation in five and higher dimensions'] For all $\alpha<\alpha_\#$, as $\left| x \right|\to\infty$
