{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:05:28.287458+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8548b02596e8151dca1da9813d1b8432cf7deb25a4d6015671da92502c201ae8","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem NormCorrAsymptotics of arXiv:2602.08739, '\large \bf MOMENTS OF C$\beta$E FIELD PARTITION FUNCTION, $\mathsf{Sine}_{\beta}$ CORRELAT'] For $\beta>0$, $N, m\in \mathbb{N}$, with $N\ge m$, we have the following asymptotics as $N \to \infty$
