{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:26.255795+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_856d2e3dc54a74176d06660ac351bba79cf4e629b29ab3c109c413e371d76f7c","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 41 of arXiv:2605.23308, 'Convergence rate estimates for semigroups and heat kernels associated with resistance form'] Let $(F_n,R_n,\mu_n,\rho_n)\in \bbF_r$ converge to $(F,R,\mu,\rho)\in \bbF_r$ in the Gromov-Hausdorff-vague topology.
