{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:58:10.025618+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_85b18395400d26c113b5788b9f621f1da92161c763b7e8864f9cf75843e0dddb","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:asym of arXiv:2607.19844, 'Binomial probabilities at a fixed distance from the mode:\\ size-biasing and the complete '] For every $k\ge1$,
