{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:32:28.994542+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_85c13b28dc6a6703e1623cf748cae93d386f68d878379ad7f942311db6753739","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem var of arXiv:2608.25362, 'Fluctuations of the free energy of the Sherrington--Kirkpatrick model with ferromagnetic i'] For any $\boldsymbol{\beta} \in \mathcal{B}$, $\gamma \geqslant 0$ and $\mu, h \in \mathds{R}$, we have
    \begin{align*}
