{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:13:18.538190+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_85df1fca55203847f3dac7183574795c1700144d77ae6cdaf9944af0760a9ba1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 28 (Asymptotic inversion, \protect{\autocite[Theorem 1.5.12) of arXiv:2608.30668, 'Recurrence and capacity of stable branching random walks'] {BinghamGoldieTeugels1987RegularVariation}}]

