{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:30:24.618557+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8609a66c9579f2172808c0e9f080de87199f1992d55ad99c50989431abb773da","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 4 (Rough integral) of arXiv:2506.09637, 'Nonlinear Stochastic Filtering with Volterra Gaussian Noises'] Let \(p\geq 1\), set \(\kappa=\lfloor p\rfloor\), and let
