{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:32:35.558390+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8610ff9f57b38012838c3199a6091ebe95d36ec78e54e901ad7611e3cef7bd87","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem lm:h-growth-rate of arXiv:2605.21366, 'The Martin boundary of the Directed Landscape'] The following holds on a full probability event.
