{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:07:56.654187+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_862df175043cedb27ce3b8b976cdb345e813c8caa3d113d8d9fc4ec6dc5737d1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition thetanhat of arXiv:2411.04603, 'The nonexplosive solution of explosive autoregressions'] We have, as $n\to\infty$,
