{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:16:18.680163+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_86939da397de6aa37ce9fc8f7490829e9fb85d1016bb534785750c1d60630922","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 9 of arXiv:2607.25986, 'Asymptotics of a two-species particle system associated to the doubly parabolic Keller-Seg'] Let $F: \R_+ \times \R^2 \to \R$ be of class $C^{2}_b(\R_+ \times \R^2)$. For all $u\geq 0$,
