{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:45:02.014912+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_86ccfc771338e7febc0b1942e5bf5066f0e10fabed60a556ad4838d6c1b4dc96","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition PROP:dec of arXiv:2512.23957, 'Concentration and fluctuations of sine-Gordon measure around topological multi-soliton man'] Let $L_\varepsilon=\varepsilon^{-\frac 12+\eta}$ and $ \min_{ \ell \neq i}|\xi_\ell-\xi_i | \ge d_\varepsilon= \big|\log  (\varepsilon \log \frac 1 \varepsilon) \big|$.

