{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:58:24.509952+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_86eb304991112b9231cf03a3eba8d9d72eeb9ddd7c30c709e250fe8e761d41b3","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn defhaplone of arXiv:2601.09537, 'Gene genealogies in haploid populations evolving according to sweepstakes reproduction'] Suppose a population evolves according to Def.\ (hschwpop of the paper).    Let
