{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:26.255859+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_87721271005f2877487d6364041bcec4365802207e4bd0638a00c9ce5d05ed09","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 42 of arXiv:2605.23308, 'Convergence rate estimates for semigroups and heat kernels associated with resistance form'] Let $f:X\to\R$ be a function on a metric space $(X,d)$
