{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:49:05.446928+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_878987c432234b1ce80e40d8c2c7bf576ca8f2ffc1a9ca0f51cbc97eb57568db","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:rep-h of arXiv:2601.10568, 'Hydrodynamic Limit with a Weierstrass-type result'] Fixed $M\in\mathbb{N}_+$, for each $0\leq m\leq M$ and $u,v\in[0,1]$ let 

