{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:51:11.461347+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_879580f5618d52e1ed9d35948f6c5b462df9e0e9443bd65d490a92eea022feaf","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Mainthm 4 (Theorem~\ref{maintheorem}) of arXiv:2609.02561, 'NON-NEF LOCI IN MIXED CHARACTERISTIC'] Let $S$ be a Dedekind scheme of characteristic zero, and
