{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:24:34.398046+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_87bfda0888f6a09365f1c11b44157652b5d770251c3496a29f8bcd35cb851c80","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 21 of arXiv:2608.31008, 'Stability of gravitational instantons with a bounded Killing vector field'] Under the same hypotheses, there is a smooth global function
