{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:27:36.747344+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_87fb6d67f13b1c2b1399716e754cbd42d15bbde87320a7c487378e7a44e38273","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 3 of arXiv:2511.19308, 'Universal scaling limits at the spectral singularity of structured random matrices'] As $\abs{\xi} \to 0$ we have
