{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:27:14.973888+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8857480765a768c28099a8fc5f075620fec464750babb88b00aedf5af2e19a7d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 18 of arXiv:2608.24352, 'Second moments associated with finite free multiplicative convolution'] Let $\gamma \in \Gammas$,
	\begin{align}

