{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:27:32.436272+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_885b9ff76aa61a6ab2ea02e316d91e85f1a57ce280a1499613120b299ac011d0","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem LK-duality-thm of arXiv:2509.23086, 'On Optimal Markovian Couplings of L\'evy Processes'] Let \(\mu, \nu \in \Lambda_2(\mathbb{R}^d)\). Then
	\begin{align}
