{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:01:01.720864+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_886944658e519e9696c6805ef590145fda1dbdf50027bac944fab5b6b6e0c061","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:ball-potential of arXiv:2608.31043, 'Sharp constants for weak estimates of Riesz Potentials when $0<s<\min\{n,2\}$'] For every $R>0$,
\begin{equation}
 I_s\rho_R(x)=1
