Here, $D\hat U(x)_t$ is the component of~$D\hat U(x)$ on the tangent space spanned by the orthonormal vectors~$(t_i(\xi(x)))_{i=1}^{d-1}$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

