{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:34:33.538039+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8897969994e2602b0b0eaa49cc7b886a6bc83edfc1c21f4ec022db5fa396ba8d","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 17 of arXiv:2603.28226, '2603.28226'] Assume the hypotheses of Theorem~\ref{thm:SGJN}. For every $N\ge1$, every atom $A\in\mathcal A_N$, and every $\beta\in(0,\alpha/e)$,
