 \end{equation*} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:01:15.321831+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_88ac7a167df5940253abd5c48075ac733f2a6c9181115752148d9608468e4710","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 2 (EMN conjecture) of arXiv:2608.30304, '2608.30304'] Put $M(\alpha,\beta)=\max\{1,(\alpha+\beta+1)^{1/4}\}$. Then
