{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:03:39.774335+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_88aca71bc25a578f0b260e95aea9e36d15dc5336966ecaf1f574f16e50b03bd1","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:increase-after-shuffling of arXiv:2411.03065, 'Growing conditioned BGW trees with\\ log-concave offspring distributions'] If ${T}$ and ${\widetildeT}$ be two plane trees such that ${T}\subseteq{\widetildeT}$, then we have
