{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:22:46.421044+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_88b86297133e6cb3c769bb55903af716483497cde202f5381d03478305ad1d5a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 58 (Hille-Yosida Theorem) of arXiv:2608.20252, '2608.20252'] For a Markov semigroup $T_t$ on $L^2(Q)$, define
