{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:15:16.647989+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_88c54a78157cb157e3c7b1508d760a3ccf00ddf2103b6d9d5da600c1da4ec975","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 7 of arXiv:2608.30736, 'Stability results for distribution-dependent stochastic Volterra equations'] Suppose that
