{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:43:45.397680+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_88f740d589bee4fdd4899f2314c88becf2a5acaecb23082294b082f754eb8625","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Mainresultd 3 (Exact profile formulas) of arXiv:2609.04143, 'The Geometry of Real Anisotropic Bohnenblust--Hille Constants'] Let $m\ge2$.
