{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:55:37.354022+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_89e1f00f06f420d738911b4ebfff33f7d687d6e59ce347691d97be00d104cd2f","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 15 of arXiv:2606.17501, 'Critical spectral behavior and large deviations for geometric $\alpha$-stable processes'] For $\theta \in \bR$, the spectral function $C(\theta)$
