{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:17:17.045417+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_89f0189a3eff7e047aeeda03f35748972fbc709ad7140e0e0855916b4c29f5d3","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 6 of arXiv:2608.19576, 'Convex order preservation for graphon mean-field systems'] Let $\varphi \in \mathbb{C}_{cv}(\mathbb{R}^d, \mathbb{R})$ with linear growth. Then, for every $m \in \mathbb{N}^*$ and $u \in I$:

