{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:05:52.388182+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_89f162704d7dc4c126b424a0826a3a40a29bbb01309ad3a1a4df69bea15805e7","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:dissipation of arXiv:2504.11107, 'An Invariance Principle for some\\% Reaction-Diffusion Equations with a Multiplicative Ran'] If Assumption (ass:par of the paper) is in force, and if $f$ additionally satisfies (equation cond:f of the paper), then
