{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:45:17.712494+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8a3f10b3a49acdff0101bd5c558ba1d5a2d73760be386251c41550a1b969d12d","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Mydef Level sets of CLCD of arXiv:2604.11761, 'The smallest singular value of signed random combinatorial matrices'] Let $H \ge H_0/2$. We define the level set $S_H \subseteq \mathbb{S}^{n-1}$ associated with the parameter $H$ as
