{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:40:22.330360+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8a87a817d1cb4e892b31e7d5f9a7c9f69d3df8e98fc9b36161e4421dbf68aa54","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma of arXiv:2609.03755, 'The Scramble Number of Outerplanar Graphs'] Let $W_m$ be the wheel graph on $m+1$ vertices. If $m = k^2+c$ for some $k\in {\mathbb Z}_{>0}$ with $0\leq c \leq 2k$, then
