{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:12:19.483031+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8a9a20da4b58294278cb1e9d696b94b69b08c696291ebbacb1f1b0b6baa7bd0d","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 8 (Continuous stable OU persistence) of arXiv:2608.17927, 'Near-unit-root persistence of symmetric stable \\ autoregressive sequences'] Let $Y$ solve \eqref{eq:ou-sde}, with $\theta, \eta, x > 0$. Then
