{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:50:48.846516+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8ad94bbc510a6e38773f62cf93721741224561e68c22e71b335553d1dbaaa4e5","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma-step2 of arXiv:2607.08187, 'Asymptotic behaviours of critical branching random walk in $\mathbb{R}^d$'] For each $\delta\in (0,1)$, it holds that 
