{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:28:33.769136+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8aea983815edf32fa0005e28e6526c14d6eaccb5aefddaa71533a44ace79e939","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem cA5 of arXiv:2504.07255, 'A Tail-Respecting Splitting Numerical Scheme\\ for L\'evy-Driven SDEs With Superlinear Dri'] For any $q\in(0,p)$,
