for all $k_1, k_2 \ge 2$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:50:48.855073+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8b1e7d7587b569f3348b3652671d95c01466c401e6af0e78bba991bad7dc31d0","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Conjecture conj:RT of arXiv:2607.12061, 'Models for species evolution with random deaths'] Let $f^\ddagger_c = \frac{qr}{p-q(1-r)}$ and suppose $p>q$. 
