{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:16:46.776704+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8b214f2a76615133882d00b4549e4e71259b482efb21c95fa2d5225ccbf55ef1","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem Feller-1 of arXiv:2411.19543, 'Feller property and convergence for semigroups of time-changed processes'] Assume that $F$ is closed. Then
