{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:57:49.847362+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8b50147234f92376549422c5ed0291399393e07e54b3df622434ec79c8dd2466","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:SecondMoment of arXiv:2410.23915, 'Asymptotic Bounds and Online Algorithms for Average-Case Matrix Discrepancy'] The second moment of $S_n(\varepsilon)$ is given by
