{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:52:51.762928+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8b565ccd930bcfcc6b8bcda8a0c76d2ebafecdbeb0b18cf141db3f2d2e68492a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:RFGbound of arXiv:2604.28068, 'Mean-square Stability and Bifurcations for Dissipative SDEs'] Suppose Assumptions~(assum:FG_bounds of the paper) and (ass:dissipative of the paper) hold and let $Y$ be the solution of (equation eq:main_YSDE of the paper).
