Assume that there exists a kernel $f \in \mathcal{H}^2$, such that, denoting $f^\sigma(r,s,x,y) \doteq f(r,s,x,y) \sigma(r) \sigma(s)$ and $\bar f \doteq (f,\dots, f) \in L^{2}(\mathbb R^{2}: L^2(\mathbb{Y}^2:\mathbb R^{(H+1)}))$, the functions defined in (equation eq:def-cntilde of the paper) satisfy, as $N \to \infty$,
