{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:33:17.740944+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8b8e73fe4092aad76360ffbf092c469e24399d6b3bdadc13d02803727c5b2dbc","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 109 (Localized first Picard smoothing) of arXiv:2607.10813, '2607.10813'] Fix an admissible spectral family and interpret $\Lambda\to\infty$ along
