{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:51:33.322598+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8bb607bd4257788d75b010d44249d4a244df174e5927a1c056285abc04bb6d7f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma (q)cof-resolution of arXiv:2608.28504, 'Global $\bm\infty$-categories and global Thom spectra'] The inclusions induce equivalences of global $\infty$-categories 
