{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:53:31.970780+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8bb7126b2fa491fdfc1eac5234866abb4556cbb5d14280a9a35e0a37b7714597","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 2 of arXiv:2606.10074, ''] Fix $v,a,b\in\{0,1\}^L$ with $a$ and $b$ satisfying
