{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:16:46.698661+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8bc37d4fda8b88482a5c33489f22a130c22583eacb2d49c257e5f5104d10120b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemDensityEstimate of arXiv:2411.18563, 'Lower tails for triangles inside the critical window'] Under Condition~(ConditionThm1 of the paper), 
