{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:05:28.235921+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8c22c32c29177cc5a044ddebd109b898b8b694b406516aaf93bcfccbacf5f051","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop: tangent processes of arXiv:2602.04429, 'Disordered systems and (subcritical) polynomial chaos\\ with heavy-tail disorder'] Let $(e_n)_{n \, \geqslant\, 1}$ and $(d_n)_{n \, \geqslant\, 1}$ be two non-negative processes which are tangent.
