{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:49:21.133394+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8c2f5b0bae3540fc639eead4b9ba554ca168f2de924793aa11cdf5d590028305","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 1 of arXiv:2608.26698, 'Mapping class groups of simply connected closed spin 5-manifolds with no 2- and 3-torsion '] Let $M$ be a simply connected closed spin 5-manifold.
