{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:10:08.702737+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8c36861859344e4bba350ad040dd2c53744b0bc0046e26078c6b58840aaa148b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem t:invariant of arXiv:2411.17524, 'Stationary measures for the Porous Medium Model'] Under Assumption~(ass of the paper), any stationary measure $\nu$ for the process with generator $\mathcal L$ can be decomposed into
