{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:57:49.859928+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8c4babb5ae424ffa9e915a148c9c6e784b36f2c4cd5f101fb447416b81b4f781","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem finite-catch-up of arXiv:2410.24170, 'Persistent hubs in CMJ branching processes with independent increments and preferential at'] Suppose that Equation~(equation eq:persistent of the paper) is satisfied. Then, in the process $(\mathscr{T}_{t})_{t \geq 0}$, the set 
