{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:20:15.587614+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8c5be1a594f71c50ad9a935d6b9a22a8c6bf9d8613ca704a15e4264dfaf83178","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:BOperator of arXiv:2609.00884, 'The weakness of typicality'] If $\mathcal{S}\subseteq 2^{\omega}$ is a small $X_0$-computational class, then
