{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:10:05.718275+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8d24c1b3795c16739bd72040d578df43701b04438ff2eb785668d8605b8591f1","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 5 of arXiv:2608.17449, 'Spectral Simplicity and Joint Eigenvalue Densities\\ for a Non-Gaussian Brownian Time Chan'] As defined above, $\Omega_{\rm Fr}(\alpha)$ satisfies
