{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:38:37.419762+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8dd1b2c8a6b523ab917662dd49ccbc88b73a25f0beb9c9cfa0e521ba43a5fd5e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 28 of arXiv:2605.16560, 'Seasonal Statistics of Shannon Rate in a Dynamical Poisson-Voronoi Cellular Network'] The following comparisons of the average Shannon rates hold true:
