{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:11:57.326725+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8dddbff2bdf74a7871187acc15368a658e09e72266acbe4cc7d761ed34b4cca0","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 6 of arXiv:2607.23585, 'The one-period Kyle model has one equilibrium'] Under the hypothesis of Lemma~\ref{lem:foc}, for every $y\in\R$, the
