{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:10:05.597188+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8de0022bd9b26862c6d6bab80f0825b5508db7a498c092dbffb63872051c89a4","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 7 (The Plancherel Theorem on $a+h\mathbb{Z}$) of arXiv:2608.16144, 'Central limit theorem in R\'enyi divergence for lattice random variables'] If $f\in \ell^1(a+h\mathbb{Z})$, then
