{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:46:36.094171+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8dee6316bfdfc67c4793ba7eff4b583f71870f4abe4787b997b0979133956eba","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:boundedness of arXiv:2609.02710, 'Asymptotic Mean Value Laplacian\\ on equiregular sub-Riemannian manifolds'] For every $K\Subset O$, there are constants $C,h_K>0$ such that
