\end{enumerate}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:37:09.019305+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8e21c931934197097c7c2d912f0c7b29f5c78cb4a1bc06fee42bd9ba6a6aba3b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:malliavin_control_bounds of arXiv:2609.01697, 'Unique ergodicity of projective cocycles over the 2D stochastic Navier--Stokes equations'] For any $n \geqslant 0$ and $K, \beta >1$, the derivative $D_W h_n$ satisfies for some
