{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:56:00.633162+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8e24189387e75a3ea060d041032f28d291eeabdc3116108be9897795414e0454","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition p3.6 of arXiv:2603.14447, '\Large \bf Backward doubly stochastic differential equations with and without reflection u'] \sl
