{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:16:18.680937+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8e7af01aa97b4232ed8008f5f521301158e4540a66605b66b7c0e919d54f06e3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 3 (\cite{QV2025}) of arXiv:2607.26223, 'The pair correlation function of the $\Sine_{6}$ process'] There is a unique vector-valued solution $\mathbf{q}_n:\CC\to \CC^n$ of the ODE system
\begin{align}
