\end{align*} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:11:09.269254+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8e86548ffce5833e0b73d35e29a8959c5caf384ae7611301439af52ed7204424","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop: estimates 1 of arXiv:2411.05924, 'Non-negative Martingale Solutions to the Stochastic Porous Medium Equation with Sticky Beh'] Let $p\in[1,\infty)$. (1) Then
