{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:33:01.784880+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8eb16ce03779123f7d322c3d4b308e3d5b2abd26252ab3058dad6ee2e8c39b46","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 43 (Isonormal Gaussian process) of arXiv:2605.14630, '2605.14630'] Let $\H$ be a separable Hilbert space. 
