    \end{equation} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:09:23.968955+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8edcdc195fe3dd1fef2d9c96ba7c584ba128b40cb98724d90633c74937361c77","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 17 of arXiv:2607.22416, 'A multi-player optimal stopping game based on a spider Brownian bridge'] \begin{enumerate}
