{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:54:15.623778+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8f96ee2caa663d4ff3624e3c98aad3110dce91ee061ef30594f4440b24f19c08","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 78 (Pure-area operator cells) of arXiv:2608.08756, 'Infinite-Dimensional L\'evy Area and Spectral Ancestry'] Let $A$ be a skew Hilbert--Schmidt operator on a real Hilbert space $H$.  For
