{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:32:28.955377+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8f979c895f8235626b2d62b09eccaa978c034ca5b9c8dfb4b53effe1f700cf5a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:variance-upper-four of arXiv:2608.23135, 'Graph distance and effective resistance of the random walk trace in four and five dimensio'] There exists $C<\infty$ such that
