{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:09:49.860408+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8f9a4c95184d1f6352fdab526b9230928f296538e35e6be8158deb91ebeaec46","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 2 of arXiv:2609.03084, 'Convergence rates to traveling waves for an FKPP model with nonlinear advection'] Suppose that $u$ solves \eqref{main_eq} with the initial data assumptions given in \eqref{initial_data_assumption}.
