where $\|A\|_F$ is the Frobenius norm and
$\|A\|_{\mathrm{op}}$ is the operator norm. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:07:35.011788+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8fab4157f3215b15999b88df6eeb701bb1d97e546609ee914e27a1f4bbe7f252","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 36 of arXiv:2609.02850, 'Canonical-row Chern flow on Bott--Samelson towers:\\ realizable-volume models for Schubert'] The conclusion of \cref{thm:canonical-packet} holds in each of the following cases.
