{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:03:39.774878+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8fb14cc91f54c6d0c2a47918aa88a2e9f187e28b137ca0c4eebbf29b2bd0a755","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop Toeplitz-TP2 of arXiv:2411.03065, 'Growing conditioned BGW trees with\\ log-concave offspring distributions'] Let ${\boldsymbol{x}}=(x_i)_{i\geq0}$ be a non-negative sequence.
