{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:55:27.253654+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8fe3a6053d1e278ceb407a86ed2c0e794290b3fc308abf698360f110c3061b34","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm expsum_2 of arXiv:2609.04092, 'Short character sums of inhomogeneous polynomials'] Let $n\geq 1$ and $k\geq 5$. Let $F=G_1(X_1)+\cdots + G_{n}(X_{n})$, where each $G_j$ has degree $k$.  Let
