{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:38:08.494024+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8fe96bfa296e6667cc3159383e3c84835dc9136464cc0d44b0f3fa1009617e1e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:bestauc of arXiv:2609.02304, 'Bayes-Optimal BER and AUC: \\Estimation and Evaluation of Estimators'] Let $x'$ be an i.i.d.\ copy of $x$.
  Then, 
