{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:17:13.062911+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8feeaac1d0fab1a5bffabb356170374f1780c33c88234b1bbb0f70cd2c203f03","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem diag_error of arXiv:2508.04954, 'Conditional exponential directed last passage percolation under a one-point upper large de'] There exists a constant $c>0$ such that
