{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:51:52.062848+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8fff4a941b125e78540b27af027179029f0274757522ffbcb5741ce038e460ef","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition fixed-curve of arXiv:2607.15966, 'Canonical Mandelbrot Cascades on Curves Are Rajchman'] A map \(\Gamma:\mathbb T\to\mathbb R^2\) is called a fixed nondegenerate
