\] (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:34:45.726365+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_902c26130b83ab80e1eb98905940f34b0110f181a46128bbd17f28c25cbc916a","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop Prop-Critical-Accumulation of arXiv:2609.01964, 'The critical exponent for the two-dimensional semilinear wave equation with strong damping'] There exist $c_+>0$ and $T_2\geqslant T_1$ such that
