{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:38:57.117402+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9058ccaac8b5afe705c8923b6a1fb45e5cf96c6c8d395574d4f0dfe3784a83be","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 17 of arXiv:2604.04823, '2604.04823'] At the saddle~$x=0$, the perturbation satisfies 
