\textstyle\Phi(\bar \theta)-\min_{\theta\in \Theta}\Phi(\theta)\leq \frac{DL_\Theta}{\sqrt{n}}+\frac{1}{n}\sum_{i=0}^{n-1}\epsilon_i.
