\]
where $\mathbf{v}_2^W$ is the second eigenvector of $W$ and $C_{\text{GOE}}$ is an absolute constant.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:55:57.008484+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_90a2a6f7f5d0fbad84371e94fed67df3c873303bbefb5726b4538ff22a825791","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 13 of arXiv:2609.02808, 'Minimizers of Laplace eigenvalues under a lower curvature bound'] On $(\Sph^2,\round)$, indexed with multiplicity,
