{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:16:46.701571+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_90e6e00dd99abef38172359c49edaf2ac2326b2d034b5502f98475e87ad95db2","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:LTtoZ of arXiv:2411.18563, 'Lower tails for triangles inside the critical window'] Under Condition~(ConditionThm1 of the paper),
\begin{align}
 \frac{1}{n^{3/2}}\log \mathbb{P}_p(X\leq \eta \mathbb{E} X)= -\frac{c}{2} - \log (1 -\zeta) \eta \frac{c^3}{6} +  \frac{1}{n^{3/2}}\log Z(\lambda,\zeta) +o(1)\,.
