{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:43:44.243320+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_91054db11b256b632e681391d6e4e522dece4ab7ddd94752347fab0d64f136d9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 3 (Asymptotic tightness) of arXiv:2604.15191, 'Quantitative Stability of Many-Marginal Schr\"odinger Bridge'] Under Assumption~\ref{assump: density_expansion}, in the special case where $\rho_t^\mu = \rho_t^\nu$ for all $t\in[0,1]$, 

