{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:43:45.379626+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_910f3457a1239eb12a8ef2ccf3155528d064cc375808f29a87a4d00100b1ba92","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 19 of arXiv:2609.03993, 'The Endpoint Fractional Riesz Estimate on the Hamming Cube'] For every finite-dimensional Hilbert space $H$, the following hold uniformly in $n$ and $\dim H$.
		\begin{enumerate}[label=\textup{(\roman*)}]
