{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:20:30.554737+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_918867323693606dc15fa6f508ed6f58be712b0f453e594f2bbc06e476de7ecf","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 8 of arXiv:2609.01826, 'An extension theory for fully fractional Schr\"odinger equations with memory'] For $z>0$ and $(\xi,\tau)\in L^+\cup L^-$, with $\theta(\xi,\tau)$ as in \eqref{phase}, let
\begin{equation}
