{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:39:41.437149+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_91925fb37835b20cdadcc9f5a3e62b47d5302261598ccee45f00b81aded8177a","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 15 of arXiv:2604.07275, 'Some probabilistic properties and time-changed versions of a renewal process based on Mitt'] The pgf $\hat{G}_{\alpha}^{f}(u,t)=\mathbb{E}\left(u^{\hat{N}_{\alpha}^{f}(t)}\right)$, $|u|\le1$ of $\{\hat{N}_{\alpha}^{f}(t)\}_{t\ge0}$  is given by 
