{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:45:27.888716+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_91962ab8ea68c8f09acbffe53ebf22e4f006f40ab614229ac8db5de863d2e0bf","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma K-bound of arXiv:2607.02742, 'Gaussian fluctuations for the parabolic Anderson model with L\'evy white noise'] For every $\alpha\geq 1$, $t>0$, $R>0$ and $p>0$,
