{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:37:14.935463+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_91c8b86b813be518c1f8e15c6b70ae10604dccf700af2c3e56e395244f229283","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 6 of arXiv:2607.11756, 'Full replica symmetry breaking in the Sherrington--Kirkpatrick model'] The processes above satisfy
