{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:51:15.020477+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_923987b614449057f20226cf13ecdbd663911b968d4c78d52eaa5b7bbe63a9e3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop RefinedMonotone of arXiv:2609.03762, '\vspace*{-2cm} Projected Riemannian Gradient Descent for the Bures--Wasserstein Barycenter'] For every $S \in \mathrm{PD}(d)$, it holds that
