        \end{equation} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:05:28.081079+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9253f29212a0edc45ac3c4ca6a96e00cd5aeec7107b0c334f7b9a0627dcb6a6f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Coro ERmb of arXiv:2601.20502, 'Optimal matching under size priority'] Under the same condition and notation of Theorem~(thm:mandatory of the paper), we have that
