{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:13:22.540863+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9286468f69abce9def310f397da5b715d8501430056e11c9b0523aeb5b7769c5","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma le:modified_source of arXiv:2506.07158, 'The diffusivity of supercritical Bernoulli percolation is infinitely differentiable'] Given $k \in \mathbb{N}_+$ and ${\scaleobj{1}{\square}}_m \in \mathcal{G}_k$, for any ${0 \leqslant i \leqslant k-1}$, and any anti-symmetric vector field defined on the induced graph of maximal cluster
