{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:48:47.297657+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_92ceef65be0b8e084379ef2931c39ec59815d8950ddab8143794cfa9e3840a99","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 2DHD-lemma5.5 of arXiv:2604.21591, '\bf Long-time dynamics of stochastic 2D hydrodynamic-type evolution equations driven by mu'] Suppose that the hypothesis of Lemma $(2DHD-lem5.1 of the paper)$ hold. Then, there exists $
