\end{align*} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:03:39.759179+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_92ecc3931a9e7abaed480d0ce71d1436db99571a8ba503c3d4c7f79134ed2765","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:moment-bound:uhat of arXiv:2411.02459, 'Existence and higher regularity of statistically steady states for the stochastic Coleman-'] { Let} $d\le 3$ { and assume the conditions} of Theorem (thm:well-posed of the paper). {Additionally assume that} \nameref{cond:phi:d=3}, \nameref{cond:Q:higher_regularity} hold for $m\ge 2$. Then

