{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:17:13.061422+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_93031712e076a4de5ddd436ac00a0d42c0feb8beddfb661141ece73e19462052","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem trivial of arXiv:2508.04954, 'Conditional exponential directed last passage percolation under a one-point upper large de'] Let $H_{\mathbf{n}}(\boldsymbol \xi, \boldsymbol \eta)$ be an integrable function that does not depend on $\mathbf{z}$. Then, the function 
