{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:37:08.321197+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_930e3325a29d33d55c4e67e90b4ad5b63d757aeb20e8eda41f72c0c9947132d9","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma l.pointwise_to_ellipticity of arXiv:2608.31071, 'Global smooth solutions to the inhomogeneous Landau--Fermi--Dirac equation'] Suppose that $g$ satisfies, for some $r>0$, $\delta\in (0,\nicefrac12)$, and $v_0\in \mathbb R^3$,
