{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:35:19.868613+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9338ddc8920a9d7f594bd5884f7a34c3b76cae2a8c2e2d0b2cf24e3da5ff97f2","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem local-drop-comparison of arXiv:2609.03856, 'Consensus time for asynchronous $\ell^p$ relaxation: graph dependence'] Let $q=p/(p-1)$.  There is $c_p>0$ such that, for every profile $f$ and
