{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:14:57.635719+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_93408c6407fb580c6905e7fc427034fe7d245ec82a8cdef7819215e80fbea599","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem: technical lemma bound on S prime of arXiv:2605.28770, 'Cutoff profiles for conjugacy invariant random walks on symmetric groups'] Let $r\geq 1$.
