{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:55:18.052213+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_936e43144fc532cfad41018d3e7904f5fe49914d8a3bc2f4442886837b7ce587","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 26 of arXiv:2606.16164, 'A Low-Regularity Semigroup Sewing Lemma via Quotient Structures'] Let $\alpha\in\mathbb R$ and $0\le \tau'\le \tau\le T$.
\begin{enumerate}
\item The restriction map
\begin{equation*}
