{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:23:25.628701+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_947e11301cdf3ca527ea71f5a9f25fad16cce6c163e251bf02319400a3061890","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:xi1-incr of arXiv:2609.01311, 'One-Layer Transformer Provably Learns Multiclass\\ One-Nearest Neighbor in Context'] For $\xi_1^t \ge 0$, there exist constants $c_1,c_2,c_3,c_4 > 0$ such that
