{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:44:17.438468+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9495578e4f0fd155e9b5aa8e656de0acced21642a3c6ed4b78722fa504d6d974","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:wta-under-lsi of arXiv:2608.23938, 'Generalization, memorization, and overfitting \\for diffusion models trained in the lazy h'] Suppose that Assumptions~(ass:high_dim of the paper) and~(ass:input_dist of the paper) hold.

