{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:45:01.978479+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_94993fcd2ba258be0a6f27bb8ad59100e09d7227133dc181a2997142ea622165","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma LEM:Moment of arXiv:2512.23957, 'Concentration and fluctuations of sine-Gordon measure around topological multi-soliton man'] Let $Y(t)$ and $\Theta(t)$ be as in (equation CY0 of the paper) and (equation CY1 of the paper).

