{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:17:42.301169+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_94c20db0c2fac1dbdbd59ec9a1472ad5bc71996299ccb5ce0845df09ee6efee8","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 9 (Identification of the coefficient at the critical scale in $d\ge 3$) of arXiv:2510.22155, 'Random walks in space-time random media in all spatial dimensions: the full subcritical fl'] Let $d
