=\log \int_{I^2} e^{\sum_{j=1,2}   {\boldsymbol v} \bullet (   x_j-   y_j) } \boldsymbol p^{(2)} \big( (   y_1,   y_2),(\mathrm d   x_1,\mathrm d   x_2)\big)   \;\; -\;\; 2 \log M(  {\boldsymbol v}).
