{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:38:08.460635+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_95157d8d958c20a9c4f4a65eef7837c34548a60fa75383f33c670e5fd25aa6b7","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:layering of arXiv:2609.02234, 'An $n(\log n)^{o(1)}$ bound for nested cycles without geometric crossings'] Let $G$ be a graph, let $r\ge2$ be an integer, and let $\beta_r=1+(r-1)^{-1}\sum_{j=1}^{r-2}(8r)^j$. If
