{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:51:11.536933+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_952c5e1cf51cdbf490e9c345f941dc9f489af22781314173fc99e66406c8ddc7","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 12 of arXiv:2609.02610, 'The frame set of the first Hermite function'] Let $N \in \N$, $N \geq 2$ and assume that the characters in \eqref{eq:V-eigenfunctions} satisfy
