{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:38:17.794586+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_953a46806d94d15269c4a5f5512e18a3ad94ca9b50c1cf877288abd33bd85e39","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:subcritical_one_arm_exponent of arXiv:2509.23496, 'Crossing probabilities in geometric inhomogeneous random graphs'] For $0\leq\gamma<\frac12$ and 
