{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:37:20.360154+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_95473f6a94bb4d7062a510b329f198a5f7e528f9057a71a73199e6a2f345d8ae","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm th.SFG of arXiv:2411.13099, 'Long time behavior of killed Feynman-Kac semigroups with singular Schr{ö}dinger potentials'] Assume that:
