{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:27:11.220633+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_959cb0669c91f9ea9d1d3e27748e497924733ee6de5c1d54ce8af9e2e0b4d32b","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition eq: self-consistent eq matrix of arXiv:2605.19894, 'Sharp Spectral Thresholds for Multi-View Spiked Wigner Models'] For a spectral parameter $z\in\CC$ and a deterministic perturbation $\Gamma\in\mathsf{Sym}_L(\RR)$, we consider the matrix Dyson equation
