{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:40.354384+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_959dcf9ee0746d253d652d030a9ffaf7c181fd475600f3708e3de5a50efcca47","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 49 of arXiv:2511.07350, 'Decoupling of clusters in independent sets in a percolated hypercube'] For all $p \in (0,1)$, 
