{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:28:04.859667+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_95a004c2e6c74ada82df800df40dd988aa0c457a711a841c661e81edbbe6a43c","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prp 15 of arXiv:2511.21496, 'Optimal local central limit theorems on Wiener chaos'] Let $a \in \R$ and $n \in \N_0$. 
