{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:56:03.895453+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_95a48b90cb54b0018b0be3c32d912254fc8b3af32702a8578f88d7ce135f0ad9","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 15 (Finite $S$-transform) of arXiv:2606.19115, 'Finite free perpetuities'] Let $p \in \polplus$ such that $p(x)\neq x^n$ and $r_n$ the multiplicity of the root $0$ in $p$. The finite $S$-transform of $p$ is the map 
