{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:45:10.069222+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_95a7eab166cd9b19086aaf4cc0d5b8dbcaa49d255a4540b6651f13cd27364acf","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:existencewave of arXiv:2504.14457, 'Abstract'] Let $W$ be the noise introduced in Definition~(DO noise def of the paper). Let $H\in (\frac{a-2}{2},1)$, where $a$ is defined in (equation eqn:a_param of the paper). The stochastic wave equation (equation eqnwave:DO process of the paper) has an almost-sure unique solution $u$ that satisfies
\begin{align}

