{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:35:59.928230+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_95b4daa45d6b2007438752ca4b84665fbe04d6e93a36efeecf17af064271965b","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 60 ({\cite[\S 3) of arXiv:2608.26084, 'Localic Esakia Duality\\via Conic Frames'] {townsend1997LocalicPriestleyDuality}}]

