{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:53:30.559255+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_95bdcb1602ebc5a2bbb3e614abeacc85476afdf2dbe0281f74211b332d2ab209","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def-class A of arXiv:2505.24043, 'Weak solutions of Navier-Stokes Equation with purely discontinuous L\'evy Noise'] \begin{enumerate}
