{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:48:49.861066+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_95c27fc7440144568e6f07b4a662ed167bb256eed802cf19c8a747aede71884e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem.LD of arXiv:2509.21253, '\bf Capacity in high dimensional percolation'] There exists a constant $C>0$ (independent of $s$), such that for any $x,y\in \mathcal H$, 
