{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:55:37.363471+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_96100357ee8e416db794a745bd50d2971523ce3c00bff9e6da2359bfda1cd4d3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 12 (Descents in symmetric shelf shuffle) of arXiv:2606.18047, 'Analysis of the asymmetric shelf shuffle'] When $p=q=1/2$, we have 
