{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:10.187518+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_961820be2d8ffeaaae6faad6ecb3b8797ee7633f5fc7561a7251b8052ccfcc71","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 135 of arXiv:2605.03236, 'Stochastic It\^o Equations and Parabolic Second-Order Equations with singular Drift'] Estimate \eqref{5.25,1} says that the operator
$f\to bP_{\alpha,k}f$ is bounded in $L_{q_{1},q_{2}}$. Its conjugate (with time reversed)
