{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:49:15.475977+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_96303c75f60f1db881e4f177a3a21ce9980631e7e95b1917a61cb367f5ed3f00","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cor box-product-bifun of arXiv:2608.28504, 'Global $\bm\infty$-categories and global Thom spectra'] For any compact Lie group $G$, the functor
