{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:23:27.796140+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_966011b7ecdefcacea4dd17ec651b2867227b844082b0ec711594c52427323cf","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cor NupperBound of arXiv:2606.11043, 'Thick points under Gaussian free field dynamics'] If $\mathrm{ET}^{\gamma}_N$ denotes the set of exceptional times with $N$ thick point. If $N$ fulfils (equation MaxN of the paper), then
