\end{equation}
For $\nu \in \Sig_n^+$ with $\nu \prec_Q \lambda$, let
\begin{equation}\varphi_{\lambda/\nu}(t)=\prod_{\substack{i \in \mathbb{Z} \\ m_i(\lambda) = m_i(\nu)+1}} (1-t^{m_i(\lambda)})\end{equation}
