\Big|\kappa\Big(\left\lbrace \eta_t^{|\bm{k}_j|+|\bm{l}_j|}\Delta_t(\bm{k}_j)\overline{\Delta_t(\bm{l}_j)}\right\rbrace_{j=1}^p\Big)\Big|\lesssim \eta_t,

