{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:32:38.638950+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9700200ebf9ae57e168a0f3fe98a0db556df76130ba0edb074ceaca4f58a7338","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 13 of arXiv:2506.17979, '\large\bf A remark on subharmonicity for symmetric Dirichlet forms'] Let ${\sf d}$ be a distance function consistent with the given topology on 
 $E$.
