{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:38:04.491336+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9732064f1c77694c9f31b4b5e9dea14dd9e6dc8be3c86c3562a73dbe0110a8e2","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem1.9 of arXiv:2607.05054, 'Root Dynamics of Differentiated Polynomials with Rotationally Invariant Structure'] Let $(m_n)_{n \geq 1}$ be a sequence of positive integers, such that 
