{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:38:08.453043+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_973ac1a45e90e0e22ece5035b489fc34d588ee13249c0c739d4286b4a275a380","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:nested of arXiv:2609.02234, 'An $n(\log n)^{o(1)}$ bound for nested cycles without geometric crossings'] A sequence $C_1,\ldots,C_k$ of cycles in a graph is a family of \emph{$k$ nested cycles without geometric crossings} if
