{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:22:59.723569+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_977905780d1d28671a560ca393b23ffd71e76719dce9c75b2316e14aaff1c619","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:negative-translation of arXiv:2608.29708, 'Intuitionistic and Constructive Modal Logics for Classical Modal Logicians'] We inductively define the \emph{(G\"odel--Gentzen) double negation translation}
