{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:32:11.135496+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9783cc4b9a22822117a02baf70ab0400a8dab02f0c6c7d7904a4390b93a23641","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:successVDalgo of arXiv:2510.12365, 'Planted clique recovery in \\ random geometric graphs'] Given $\alpha = \lim_{n \to \infty} \mu_n /\log(n)$,
