{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:38:17.813400+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_97bdf699acdf4af7665e989184dd7f7b827de84e0dcc6aacdafc6946df95efc2","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition of arXiv:2510.07682, 'From tug-of-war to Brownian Boost: \\ explicit ODE solutions for player-funded stochastic-'] To $(S_-,S_+) \in \mathcal{S}_0^2$, associate $(b,a):\ensuremath{\mathbb{Z}} \to [0,\infty)$ as usual. 
