{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:25:40.076207+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_981157bc0a12b4a07d8424340c5312788e309d14aace776c38c91567d9af123f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 12 of arXiv:2510.26216, 'A functional Breuer-Major theorem with Poisson noise'] \cite[Lemma~3.1]{nualart_breuer_clt}
