{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:11:44.390038+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_98121fffcece65fb7f96a9a1ff051d1512f4259dd01d2fbb092ae23236c0867e","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 2 of arXiv:2609.03143, 'Equilibria for Networks of Linear Translational Springs'] Let $N = (P, S)$ be a rigid spring system in dimension $2$. Assume that $N$ has $n$ nodes and $s$ linear springs. 
