{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:56:49.279855+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_984db3149f39ec18740c647ce402bffc411d1249029cf69694705d0f1913905a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 8 of arXiv:2606.22611, 'Upper and Lower Bounds on Expected Soft Maxima\\of Gaussian Processes'] Let $X = (X_t)_{t \in T}$ be a centered Gaussian process with a discrete index set $T$, such that
