{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:37:08.955317+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_989d9cd203043de9093eeb8ccea93e424f1d887571aa32b726ebfd32d6d5adc2","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:bernstein_current_1 of arXiv:2609.01581, 'Concentration of additive functionals of Stratonovich-type'] Under the assumptions of Theorem~(thm:explicit_current_1 of the paper), for all $t>0$ and
