{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:57:20.585122+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_99442dead7d4162f744d1de24e02468d8336f18447ce6f9f67c9503d7b8723bc","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Le33 of arXiv:2411.09949, '$W_{\bf d}$-convergence rate of EM schemes for invariant measures of supercritical stable '] Suppose that for some $\gamma \in [0,1]$ and $\kappa_0 > 1$,
