{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:49:17.488725+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_995902e196a4847ea6f405f5b64d5a1e0085803bd3c055669aefc25ea5b124e5","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 9 (Kadanoff--Ceva correspondence for continuum domains) of arXiv:2605.28473, 'The BKT transition and surface tension differentiability'] Let $\Gamma$ denote any simply connected continuum domain, and fix $\beta\in[0,\infty)$.
