{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:57:28.711089+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_99b56b05fd61920ac447e5f3ed97601da71bd2ef3fd56739d5bcde8e942d1043","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 12 (Energy of a lifted flow) of arXiv:2609.01143, 'The voter model on the hyperbolic graph'] The lifted flow has divergence and energy
