{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:51:15.022661+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_99ea16015f445f6f848c3cf1d65d71f81b84e3b35a017fe9abea6b7a2dabda79","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem L4.2 of arXiv:2609.03848, 'The mean-field limit of the Schr\"{o}dinger-Lohe model\\ and emergent dynamics'] Let  $\{ (\phi_k, V_k) \}$ and $\{ ({\tilde \phi}_k, {\tilde V}_k) \}$ be solutions to (equation C-1 of the paper). Then, one has
