{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:22:46.461606+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9a186fe4402eec9fced7ff512b3053b1de67f3c131ca0f9c4b947e8f563ef120","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 18 (The acoustical metric) of arXiv:2609.03101, 'The emergence of the Cauchy horizon from the crease for $3D$ compressible Euler flow'] Relative to the Cartesian coordinates $(t,x^1,x^2,x^3)$, 
