{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:41:03.321030+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9a229011833a939a196a981cb60a0e02fa095935292b879701d779d3877ca937","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma le:nthchaos of arXiv:2411.09058, 'Time-dependent averages of a critical long-range stochastic heat equation'] For any $n\geq 1$, $R>0$, setting  $\eta_0=0$, we have
