{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:30:50.709313+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9a2e69cc1359141cbbab2e381eecfb580559df5d1fd5721fa29176d1300ed1e0","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem secular of arXiv:2609.01034, 'The Multiple Timescales of Gradient Descent on~the~Edge~of~Stability: A~Perturbative~Deriv'] Let $\alpha, \beta \in \mathbb{R}$. The solutions $\varphi = \varphi(t_1)$ of the difference equation
