{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:53:54.919399+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9a34311bdf4fd62f59062d2090ff0b59c01649b769190b529f82b791d0aa251b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 7 of arXiv:2607.17192, 'Geometric Regime--Switching Diffusions on Stratified Riemannian Spaces with an Application'] The class \(\cl D_0\) is measure determining
