{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:09:59.301881+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9a34f0171bc46268028e833bc00156f740c08e41b884a7433f57340a270dfb88","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop of arXiv:2608.06644, 'Applications of the cluster graphing'] The following equivalence relations are nonapproximable:
