{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:18:19.412770+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9a5f90c1a188ac8ea440982e71b058540e55837349ae57eccc3751d24126ef75","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem of arXiv:2507.21235, 'Chase-escape with conversion as a multiple sclerosis lesion model'] \thlabel{thm:pt}
