{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:54:12.310646+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9b6064d87da4d5e156e62d02e7923b9851852f1fda352845c598951cad4d5a57","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem \cite{ElieAidekonZhanShiAOP809}, Theorem 1.1 of arXiv:2603.14302, 'On Partition Functions for Time-Inhomogeneous Branching Random Walks'] We have the Seneta–Heyde scaling for Derivative martingale $D_\infty$:  
