{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:33:11.996626+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9b9137e0e49929b3f1c264dc78ccd36907041fc6c89fe20c30ca61e381c58ff0","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:gamma-sum of arXiv:2609.02820, 'Sharpness and critical scaling of parking'] For every $n\geq1$,
