\end{itemize}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:12:46.878211+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9bbd79d35f239503c218142d59ba08f2428be1594113bdb73373f86f5d14b77d","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:infinite-singlecross of arXiv:2608.09368, 'A proof of Ross's conjecture for two-site moving-target search'] Under the strict-interior positive-determinant assumptions,
