{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:40.351666+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9bda6e23f36307e5a70758e6fa14b5abb8fa4800cc61d01c176ea3df027ef4bc","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 10 of arXiv:2511.07350, 'Decoupling of clusters in independent sets in a percolated hypercube'] There exists a universal constant $\gamma > 0$ such that for $p > \fr{1}{2}-\gamma$,
