        \mathcal{S}_\theta\hspace{-.1em}:=\hspace{-.1em}\left\{f\in C^\infty([0, 1]): \hspace{-.5em}\begin{array}{ll}\partial_u(\mathfrak{A}_\theta^k f)(0)=\boldsymbol{1}_{\{1\}}(\theta)\lambda \mathfrak{A}_\theta^k f(0), \\ \partial_u(\mathfrak{A}_\theta^k f)(1)=-\boldsymbol{1}_{\{1\}}(\theta)\delta \mathfrak{A}_\theta^k f(1)\end{array}  \hspace{-.1em}\text{for all integers} \ k\ge0\right\}.
