{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:22:48.886934+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9c4fcd450d9e3b02afbf820157df22e767ef9cdb7adbb3d08890fb577275c717","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 29 of arXiv:2608.29157, 'Dilator-based analysis of $\KP$'] For an increasing $f\colon\alpha\to\beta$, we recursively define
