{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:55:18.939933+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9c57e216d90794c2a685570b63bc1959b995718b7b59e54877597608400d8fbd","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition eq:tildeA of arXiv:2602.08591, 'The Yang--Mills measure on compact surfaces as a \\ universal scaling limit of lattice gau'] The  random distribution $\tilde{A}$ defined upstairs on the cylinder 
