{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:34:45.754016+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9c8063c5751d7eacd92fc3e0109814078dc32e6fa8f7f2a078d1836817cb245c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma conclassdecomp of arXiv:2609.01990, 'Jacquet-Zagier treatment of the beyond endoscopy trace formula for \(\GL_2\)'] For any non-central conjugacy class $C$ represented by an element $\lambda$, 
