{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:02:28.627965+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9d1260800f2c5413e01e59c06ef4a746ed4212e4f54c6d77771df937eb3ae538","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 1 of arXiv:2609.01362, '{Double cluster swapping for spin models: \\Pfaffian relations and sharpness}'] Let $G=(V,E)$ be a finite graph and let $\vp \in \R^V$ be distributed according to
