\lesssim&\int_{\mathbb{T}^2}\Psi(\rho_0)\mathrm{d}x+\sqrt{\varepsilon}\int_0^t\int_{\mathbb{T}^2}
\frac{s_{\eta}(\rho)}{\rho}\nabla\rho\cdot
\xi_{K}
+\varepsilon N_KT+1,
