&+\sqrt{\varepsilon}\int_{0}^{t} \int_{\mathbb{T}^2} s_{\eta}(\rho) \nabla \psi \cdot \xi_{K}-\frac{\varepsilon F_{1,K}}{2} \int_{0}^{t} \int_{\mathbb{T}^2} \left[s_{\eta}^{\prime}(\rho)\right]^{2} \nabla \rho \cdot \nabla \psi. 
