\end{enumerate}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:48:49.903066+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9d3fdcf6b15d629fe50f3709492c6fe8ae9874cd9581dccd930c06410db643ef","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 2dsubcriticalSHE of arXiv:2511.08479, '\Large From disordered systems to the Critical 2D Stochastic Heat Flow'] Let $u^\varepsilon(t, x)$ be the solution of the mollified 2D SHE  (equation eq:mollSHE of the paper) with disorder strength
