{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:13:18.513827+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9d4559dee3a80a49a98afd852d70670359415676b0f376740b3468f3b89ef96d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 8 of arXiv:2608.30602, '2608.30602'] Let $0<\lambda_0<1$, and suppose that 
