{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:59:45.477179+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9d5305d1022d3f287ec5fc4a2b793197b80286ff2c5688e47516b942d0f701b5","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 1df of arXiv:2411.16647, 'The stochastic evolution of an infinite population with logistic-type interaction'] Fix  separating $\mathcal{F}\subset C_{\rm b}(\Gamma)$ and $\mu_0\in \mathcal{P}(\Gamma)$. 
