{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:34:33.535653+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9d5b488e63a15bba2eb2b275c6de1a6859fd24015b8da0bc2295b41de4c80a22","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 7 of arXiv:2603.28170, 'Stabilization time of finite configurations with a second class particle in discrete TASEP'] \begin{enumerate}
