{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:21:56.740279+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9d9547eb742cfbd01dc1122294f808229d99ad7a4de862a82cc4c792414c5961","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma estimate of arXiv:2507.19222, 'Convergence of the KMP model to the KPZ equation'] For all $\phi\in C_{c}^{\infty}$,  $t,s\in[0,T]$ with $s<t$, and  $\epsilon\in(0,1/2)$,  we have the estimate
