{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:16:53.613767+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9d9cd4681d9e1ff2497a5bcc0ceb7444f8f4833381f78d58c3b4fa7fafe618b7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:Pi_moments of arXiv:2412.05491, 'Near-critical and finite-size scaling for \\ high-dimensional lattice trees and animals'] Let $d > 8$, $p \in [\tfrac12 p_c, p_c)$, and $m<m(p)$.
