{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:35:10.793302+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9dea77c2f434d7ddb43347a3572375573b412be2c731e48f4d41582a6ebebdeb","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemme 24 of arXiv:2604.00635, 'Large deviations of the periodic Toda chain'] Let $\mu\in \mathcal{G}_{\kappa}$ for some $\kappa > 0$, and also $\int x \, \dd\mu(x)=0$. Then

