{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:51:00.236134+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9e38c0a2a29f7e189594fe199038247e2f71a2e4039d6d01bd63379888f54931","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:uniformestimateofauxiliary of arXiv:2604.22510, 'Asymptotics of Multi-Scale McKean--Vlasov Diffusions with Super-Linear Kernels: a Lifted S'] For any $T>0,p\geq 2$, we have
