{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:56:00.644470+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9e39edd34a60ef5a7256e06db6af3d66f79f2c290962e0b5694383a64d7c4a8d","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition ping of arXiv:2603.17861, 'Gaussian concentration, integral probability metrics, and coupling functionals\\ for infin'] Let $\mu\in\mathscr{M}_\tau^1(\Omega)$ and let $C>0$. We say that $\mu$ satisfies the
