The pointing $p$ of $\mathcal{M}$ gives rise to an equivariant identification $\mathscr O(\alpha)\cong SO(3)/\Gamma, \Gamma\in\{1, SO(2), SO(3)\}$ for each orbit, and hence a privileged cell structure on $\mathscr O(\alpha)$ for which $p_\alpha$ is its unique $0$-cell.","status":"unverified"}

