{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:47:01.657921+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9f3a618a050f39aa2f7ba65a2fa7505e5657b4caf2f8d52dfe4f593fb3682674","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 8 (Comparison model approximation) of arXiv:2604.23461, 'Scaling limit of Sinkhorn-rescaled Random Matrices \\ via Stability of Static Schrödinger '] Suppose Assumptions \ref{assump:random_matrix}--\ref{assump:bounded_cost} hold. 
