{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:11:57.341746+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9f3b549483b13624bee87ddb4f26a6f41cb7c431f58b341dd4f6c66fb8b960fd","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 26 of arXiv:2607.23791, 'Precise cover times for branching random walks on Hamming graphs: (iterated) logarithmic c'] Let $N_y(t)$ be the number of particles at $y$ at time $t$ and denote by 
