{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:43:44.239797+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9f69c80c51066e4603677fb34191916780bfa5046dcf0c5a97e79dc359eecb30","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theo 2 of arXiv:2604.14752, 'Strong and weak rates of convergence in the Smoluchowski--Kramers approximation for stocha'] Let Assumptions~\ref{ass:fLip}, \ref{ass:mapping-f},~\ref{ass:noise} and \ref{ass:init-weak} be satisfied.

