{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:30:52.739685+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9fdf0f8194ec78b377fb3164fb7af20867e8e1423db5ee0eca4d42eceb0526e9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 15 of arXiv:2506.10494, 'Geometric Jensen-Shannon Divergence Between Gaussian Measures On Hilbert Space'] [\cite{Minh:2022Kullback}, Theorem 12]

