{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:19:42.675188+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a03a99faa34dd52e900b588cdf9b771b7a91baa56261f574105aeb44036a308b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 18 of arXiv:2609.03556, 'An Effective SPDE Model for a Schr\"odinger Equation with a Fluctuating Magnetic Potential'] \label[lemma]{compactness_fluctuations}
