 \leq & 2 \chi(\rho_{\alpha}) \chi(\rho_{\beta})  \| \nabla H  \|^2_{2,n} (t-s)^2    \| f_{\varepsilon} \|^2_{2,n} \; \| g_{\varepsilon} \|^2_{2,n} \varepsilon.
