{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:20:30.554184+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a040285f9c9676df7868a195fc61ffca19ab1f1917c58350a048643741e1398e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 1 of arXiv:2609.01826, 'An extension theory for fully fractional Schr\"odinger equations with memory'] The semigroup $\{P^\Le_\sigma\}_{\sigma>0}$ extends to a unitary one on $L^2(\RNu)$, i.e., one has 
