{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:49:15.412461+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a067537812439984ef1f936e1896f5fdf447d898a4bcd11556aebc619383ff02","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:finite_time_entrance of arXiv:2608.27313, 'A Finite Sample Analysis for Quantile Temporal Difference Learning in Distributional Reinf'] For every $T\ge8$,
