{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:24:25.989399+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a06b27719ae01fd354477b70429d27b70e70164d5ec7060f69185e010c2fb77f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Conjecture 80 of arXiv:2507.07702, 'Observables of random spanning trees in random environment'] There exists a constant $k > 0$ such that with high probability
