{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:30:50.709969+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a0786fe3c1955107b417ab3a3df760fb2fb880eda91826851a8764a53017519f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:index of arXiv:2609.01270, 'Farey Structure in Modulo Krinkle Tilings:\\ Mediant Splicing and Generation of Prototiles'] Let $m_1/k_1<m_2/k_2$ be Farey-adjacent and $(m,k)=(m_1+m_2,k_1+k_2)$. Then
