{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:48:27.282871+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a0aa002b0603f5632cddf26bc4cb9fd5c17c3680387f556d603c5690649cb33d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 13 of arXiv:2604.25336, 'Central limit theorem for slow-fast system under mixed fractional Brownian motion'] Under assumptions \textbf{H1}-\textbf{H3}. Define \(\hat g(x,y):=g(x,y)-\bar g(x)\) and 
