{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:42:39.076014+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a0b5ba5153f91197b31d4cab821fda3fa86c584253edae4d57483b0a77f2d3c9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm convergence of sizes and surpluses of ER of arXiv:2412.08236, 'Aging and sub-aging for Bouchaud trap models on resistance metric spaces'] [{[Aldous_97_Brownian]}]  
