{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:49:06.337427+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a0d89e181a8ca389e0fb0132bcda1cdaf35e0a12297091682c296cb1181696eb","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:elementraryI of arXiv:2601.19630, 'Mass generation for the two dimensional O(N) Linear Sigma Model in the large N limit'] For $\lambda \geq e$ it holds
