{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:55:37.822495+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a0dacf6095096ddb6313534a832adba9312d426ac4ae1bffec9d57e4d208431a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem limitXn of arXiv:2605.06488, 'Continuous-state branching processes with L\'evy-Khintchine drift-interaction: Laplace dua'] For all $x\in [0,\infty]$, all $n\geq 1$,
