{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:37:09.019454+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a13344ec5cb7225f6fd18912726d349a09f619b68def26f1e49f5ad0487fb8e1","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:summability of arXiv:2609.01697, 'Unique ergodicity of projective cocycles over the 2D stochastic Navier--Stokes equations'] Fix any $K, \beta > 1$ and define $h_n$ as in~(equation eq:control_h of the paper). For
