{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:00:15.224923+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a133701231d8f11fa112456a8b5c997d8f085a67d46328db8b9eb5dd7cbaf556","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 1 of arXiv:2607.18619, 'Chernoff's Density Is Strongly Log-Concave'] For the density function $g$ in \eqref{eq:M-def} and $\curv, \curvg$ in~\eqref{eq:v-kappa}, 
