{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:47:32.860883+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a13e99e7f68e03209fc2a67a71fadbaf134d07666989066313d52470dfee1f7a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 18 of arXiv:2609.02423, '2609.02423'] Let $\nu$ be any chart and let $m_{N,\Gamma}$ be the symbol defined in
\eqref{eq:mNy-band-def}, whose high-frequency support is contained in
\eqref{eq:band}.  Set
