{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:06:55.278276+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a14bfeeec8b69be57cb19a3c2c07c5674b01ef0b6359941272f77ebbb4711b93","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:raivc of arXiv:2601.08184, 'Wasserstein-p Central Limit Theorem Rates: From Local Dependence to Markov Chains'] Consider the objects \(\mathcal S = (\Xi,\{V_\xi\}_{\xi\in\Xi},\mu,\psi,\{\nu_\xi\}_{\xi\in\Xi})\) constructed in
