{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:02:38.595482+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a164b04ece3de62c8fb286bad543213f8a10829de8f9212aba9f1f85b7ff91d8","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 10 of arXiv:2607.07022, 'Coordinate-wise Elephant Random Walk'] Let $f:Q_k\to\R$ be bounded. Write $n=Mt_0+r,$ with $0\leq r <t_0.$ Define
    \begin{equation}
