{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:10:05.598662+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a1814e7aaf54e6a46f5ab7bb5241e31f98dbe7ab944a549d732d89dea2125155","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 24 of arXiv:2608.16144, 'Central limit theorem in R\'enyi divergence for lattice random variables'] Let $n \in \mathbb{Z}_{\geq 1}$ and $k\in \mathbb{Z}$. For every fixed $y \in \mathbb{R}$, it holds that
