{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:23:25.625303+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a19a0e4e24e1b50e969c066b6e0e7b1ba980d5e458e573528f3374770c42728a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem_away_infty of arXiv:2609.01250, 'Global regularity for 2D gravity water waves with two retreating point vortices'] Assume the bootstrap assumptions. There holds
