{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:26:47.147856+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a1cb3a3b29346b0bf791793faf7f8d1d9cf24bff869a4efb37d6633277a80259","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 5 of arXiv:2608.29361, 'Convergence of the subcritical $\gamma$-LQG metric to the critical $2$-LQG metric as $\gam'] Let $h$ be a whole-plane GFF normalized such that $h_1(0) = 0$. For all $\xi>0$, we set
