{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:15:16.647621+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a1df132b9b71cb94d16753748c6fd38c237157c5aea1f74f39f460c6ce5d7482","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 3 of arXiv:2608.30736, 'Stability results for distribution-dependent stochastic Volterra equations'] Suppose that
