{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:16:49.558501+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a22696a1bf5f3818e523eb68d5792e335c28d9afe9d52a1500c62060f7915e33","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 25 of arXiv:2509.06869, 'Infinite Interacting Brownian Motions and EVI Gradient Flows'] The following properties hold:
\begin{enumerate}[{\rm (a)}]
