    \end{align}
    where the equality makes sense in $H^{-s-2}_{\div}$ thanks to (cor:stoch_int_bd of the paper).","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:59:58.428809+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a28d24c13bcfb5212d14c8397bfd76535adee4595abbe05d0ec0a4609ea10a25","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:moments of arXiv:2604.20094, 'Persistence and local extinction for superprocesses in random environments'] Let $\nu\in {\mathcal M}_F({\mathbb R}^d)$ and $f\in C_b({\mathbb R}^d)$. Then
