{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:23:25.633103+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a2d795cc27f0d5198add457c40be8c13d81ebb0dfc11b0872f7a8f70abc0dce0","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:nn-conc of arXiv:2609.01311, 'One-Layer Transformer Provably Learns Multiclass\\ One-Nearest Neighbor in Context'] {li2024onelayer}}]
With $\mathbf{x}_{i^*}$ as above and $k_d$ as in (lem:ip-density of the paper),
