\end{align}In $d=1$ the right side can be improved to $C^{m+1}|  {\boldsymbol{v}}|^{2pm} / (m/2)!$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:46:25.370028+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a31f76fd064013bd36588daf9d07098f6f3adbe774c9e4a601998c0998f7c0c3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem Thm 2 pts disk R of arXiv:2604.15146, 'Renormalised two-point functions of CLE$_4$ gaskets'] Fix $R>1$.
