{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:23:27.794790+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a383e400c59be2d8371f2c29d567ad120848e1c1720bf0fecdaa861d70bd5c90","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn tpSTD of arXiv:2606.11043, 'Thick points under Gaussian free field dynamics'] Take $\gamma>0$  and $\Psi$ the SHEF. We define 
