{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:01:25.653989+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a3edb18a4c768f6a752a5e92b09046e87226a78dfec3facbdb80055015a07d78","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lm:Input-for-complex-analysis-lemma of arXiv:2605.16162, 'Deconfinement For $\mathrm{SO}(3)$ Lattice Yang--Mills at Strong Coupling'] Suppose $\ell$ is a rectangular loop in $\Lambda$ with both side-lengths at least $15$. Then
