    \end{align*} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:01:39.494692+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a43aa88bb109581e0e4f03e30c03e4ac28fb9bf4608d8c78f38168cfa8fae46f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:forest_estimates of arXiv:2607.22291, 'Rare subtree patterns in size-conditioned Bienaymé trees: Poisson approximation and declum'] Let $\mathcal G_\ell$ be a forest of $\ell$ independent Bienaym\'e trees.
