{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:52:17.375369+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a444a914684d89f1a475bbcc19667227ec6352ec3e0e48c6b2932f3f01dac9b7","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 10 of arXiv:2606.04636, 'A Thomson-type variational principle for diffusion coefficients'] The divergence and gradient are adjoint up to
