{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:53.188170+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a4a9970caa91ad73486d3db0339dc33ab5a9371d0a426631ad9335ecc34b5b31","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 7 of arXiv:2606.30411, 'Notes on constants for maxima of Rademacher averages'] Let \(G_1,\ldots,G_p\) ($p\in\Nb$) be independent standard normal random variables. Then
