{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:14:37.646544+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a5482bafe0d8d1c8543124411774dcc5b746bb78e3488634496c7cab47098a52","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 1 of arXiv:2608.19560, '\textbf{Computing transient probabilities in Markovian queues with balking conditional on '] For each $|z| \leq 1$, the unconditional PGF $\bm{p}^*(z,t)$ is
