{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:22:21.883264+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a5825453f1882c0e1cd969c658bf8dab3bca66f1b5a20aec03ca8f28ab19de0c","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:momentmap of arXiv:2411.11345, 'Real Gaussian exponential sums via a real moment map'] We define the following \emph{potential} function $\Phi:M\to\mathbb{R}$ given for all $x\in M$ by 
