{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:36:31.225832+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a59bd7514558e34c32aa562f8010359b4c5506c22639ea1fd040f92d5b71fbc8","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 3 of arXiv:2609.00537, 'Explicit Exponential Sum Estimates and Approximate Functional Equations for the Zeta Funct'] Let $s = \sigma + it$ with $\s \in (0,1]$ and $t \geq  t_0 \geq 14 $. We have 
