{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:30:14.222180+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a5a5c78391c9dbd565ee80ee66d01126bd15e927b137ea49002663c3062c2fe5","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:drift-heat of arXiv:2608.20537, 'Persistent anisotropy in multi-dimensional\\ branching Brownian motion'] Let $v(s, y; t)$ solve 
