{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:04:55.809611+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a5dafa3bb943c1e3b3a10baf9a03d47b5e9c8784b9053737437ebaf90315c9c4","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemm l:restrict-to-Good of arXiv:2607.18194, 'Temperature chaos in directed polymers'] There exists $c>0$ such that for all sufficiently small $\varepsilon>0$ and all $k\in \llbracket 0,M\rrbracket$,  we have
