{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:59:25.040183+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a5e678edb298a1ba34596c7913bd24621793fde9cf1f1b1787949d50c48fd12b","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 7 of arXiv:2606.31596, 'The Invariant Measure of Multiscale Markov Chains via Fast Arborescence Factorization'] Let $(V,E,r_N)$ be a strongly connected weighted graph satisfying Assumption \ref{FRL2}.

