{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:38:25.225695+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a61a62ae955a7f233a955cdaaf90050ce6a3dfd10abd8aac115a5e86130cb3ce","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem main-thm of arXiv:2609.00627, 'Global well-posedness of radially symmetric strong solutions to two-dimensional compressib'] Assume that 
	\begin{equation}
