{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:29:00.763485+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a6c5add227785d19a4f1c5c178907e0e398bbfee89594055cbd50ec595393501","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 5 (Finite 2D $\rho$-variation) of arXiv:2512.04646, '\textbf{Canonical Rough Path over Tempered Fractional Brownian Motion: Existence, Construc'] Let $H > 1/4$ and $\rho = 1/(2H)$. Then
