{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:47:53.353437+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a6d32ad331421b54d953d4c24a7e5d81c7b865bdd393b5c8cb4a9349f248824a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 3 of arXiv:2607.16017, 'On large networks of integrate-and-fire neurons with short-term synaptic plasticity'] The invariant probability measure $ \mu_\infty^\alpha ( \d v , \d x) $ has the following properties.
	\begin{enumerate}
