{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:56:25.271111+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a6d3ccba33ab600edd4ba7aab59d43f76b14afcc880ff7fdf8e661a4b4f00791","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 1 of arXiv:2606.21042, 'Absolute Continuity of Monotone Aggregations under Positive Regression Dependence'] Let $g\colon \R\times S\to \R$ be $\cB\otimes \mathscr S$-measurable with
