{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:50:36.763116+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a6ff0214cbb0d55900284994f3ab241d9fb6388c9461d07e142691f3b54e3847","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 10 (Properties of Bessel functions) of arXiv:2609.04155, 'The subconvexity problem for symmetric square\\ $L$-functions in Level aspect'] For $x>0$, and $r\in\R\cup i\R$
