{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:27:36.721130+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a6ff59710aff6b96a012d0bc19db3b0b34c9c08c6dc264c0c23c73ab2e9ad1a2","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 27 of arXiv:2511.13404, 'Asymptotic stability and mean ergodicity of Feller processes on Polish spaces'] Let $\mu\in \mathcal{P}(\X)$ be an ergodic invariant measure for $\Phi$ and $f\in B(\X)$. If there exists $\bar{\X}\in\mathcal{B}(\X)$ with $\mu(\bar{\X})>0$ and for $x\in \bar{\X}$
