{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:33:23.332579+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a722903b9cf543cb1e448b680dd7099cc8862c0777bfad09d1a9fc7db482b096","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 3 of arXiv:2506.22085, '2506.22085'] Fix $T>0$ and $\mu_0,\mu_1\in \ms M_+(\bb T^d)$ which we assume to
