{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:38:17.796913+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a783f18dcb8045e1b4343d77a1a951c28108188521c54f52e9015b5302a8f046","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:one_edge_2_le_delta_1_gamma of arXiv:2509.23496, 'Crossing probabilities in geometric inhomogeneous random graphs'] The one-edge crossing probabilities satisfy, for $|x|=R$,
