{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:27:36.718899+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a7bfffc3f2f36a10eefdc84fdb389279867711c23f7184d4d8008dc6022acaed","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 14 ({\cite[Theorem 6.8) of arXiv:2511.13404, 'Asymptotic stability and mean ergodicity of Feller processes on Polish spaces'] {Villani2009}}]

