{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:18:19.224920+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a7c0911e0b54078cf3f4fd0d10e6713b97b9e2246e3ba134f5e737220f936e44","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 16 of arXiv:2608.29086, '2608.29086'] [Interaction between molecules]
