{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:27:11.329014+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a7ca1f70eb3c5532d5f70d44ee1704e585ac6e74d0a3238670e76334695eb972","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:thetatozero of arXiv:2605.20587, 'Persistence and entropic repulsion of stationary Gaussian fields with spectral singularity'] \begin{equation} 
