{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:38:58.723999+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a7dc292bf016eae66eb05b14792f2a38f487ffa24bb67d6b924290f12eb9b399","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eq:oxCovVV of arXiv:2511.06321, 'Torus scaling limits and the plateau of the critical weakly coupled $|\varphi|^4$ model in'] For $V_j \in \cV$ and $j < N$,
\begin{align}
	\sigma_{\sf ox}^{-1} \operatorname{Cov}_{\pi,j+1} [ \theta V_y  ; \theta V_z ] &= \sum_{\km_3, \km_4 \in \ko_1 \cup \ko_{1,\nabla}} \Big( \lambda^{(\km_3)}_{{\sf o}} \lambda^{(\km_4)}_{{\sf x}} \nabla^{\km_3}_{y}  \nabla^{\km_4}_{z} \Gamma_{j+1} (y-z) \one_{y={\sf o}, z={\sf x}} 
	 \\
		& \qquad\qquad\qquad + \lambda^{(\km_3)}_{{\sf x}} \lambda^{(\km_4)}_{{\sf o}} \nabla^{\km_4}_{x'}  \nabla^{\km_3}_{x''} \Gamma_{j+1} (y-z) \one_{y={\sf x}, z={\sf o}} \Big)  \nonumber
