{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:51:26.647968+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a7eacd21402289f6b32022176b4ffcf367ed2f76e06be834f0f6d23bec9b2134","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma L:interchangelimit of arXiv:2606.03079, 'Mean Field Limits for Stochastic, Underdamped Reactive Langevin Dynamics Models'] Consider $g_t(m,\zeta) \coloneqq \mathbb{E}\left[\int_0^t \left\langle |v|^2 \mathbbm{1}_{\{m-1 \leq |x| + |v| \leq m\}} , \mu_{s-}^{\zeta,j}(dx,dv)\right\rangle ds\right]$. Then
