{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:35:10.786484+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a7eaefeec418971d3be1e382bc7ebf4e4785605a9ab5cfd2710609183a9e97ad","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 13 of arXiv:2604.00598, 'Allowing for Imprecision in the Game-theoretic Characterisation of the Poisson Process'] For any two time points~\(s,t\in\posreals\) such that \(s\leq t\) and \(m\in\nats\),
