{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:31:57.917393+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a86631dd51816f870e8af9177b4cb0a33e3eb69ab4669477103c05fc5128b6b4","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:3d-coul of arXiv:2510.18392, 'Hyperuniformity of random measures, transport and rigidity'] Let $ x_{ n}\in B(0,\rho _{ -}^{ (n)}),n\geqslant 1$, $ \mathsf{P}^{ d,\beta }$ a limit point of $   \{  \tau _{ -x_{ n}}\mathsf{P}^{ d,\beta }_{ n};n\geqslant 1\}$ in the vague topology. Let $ \gamma>0,\varphi \in   \mathscr  F_{ \gamma }$ $ \Leb$-a.e. continuous.

