{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:36:12.188857+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a88057f81651666ae43736eaee9cb9104e342af15ba27d6b4985780cb64ad818","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 2 of arXiv:2609.03916, 'Halfspace Theorems for Anisotropic Minimal Surfaces and Perimeter Minimizers'] Let $U\subset\R^{n+1}$ be open.  A set $E\subset\R^{n+1}$ of locally finite
