{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:31:20.596024+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a8c538b8f8c26d18c38634990faac9c4a6160a8bedf653844b1e2524460ffe83","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 22 (Regular spectral design) of arXiv:2608.25706, 'Fast rates in Bayesian online learning with approximate posteriors'] {lem:gp-design}
