{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:21:56.727433+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a8cdced928a1b970192993db4949431b5c50f7fc827b9ba0c855f62aa109be52","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary co:quantiles_metric of arXiv:2507.15589, 'Tightness of approximations to metrics on non-simple conformal loop ensemble gaskets'] Suppose $\met{\cdot}{\cdot}{\Gamma}$ is a ${\rm CLE}_{\kappa'}${} (pseudo-)metric in the sense of Definition~(def:cle_metric of the paper). Let $\median[\delta]{}$ and $\quant[\delta]{q}{}$ be as defined in Section~(se:intersections_setup of the paper). Then
