{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:54:18.292413+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a8d17ffb9e13faf9ad6ac1dbc2f88c71b751b78193f98b611a23b582b6558ee2","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:pointwise-smooth of arXiv:2608.30166, 'Square Functions and Rectifiability\\ under Monotone Transformations of the Density'] Under the hypotheses of Theorem~(thm:smooth of the paper), for all $x\in\operatorname{supp}(\mu)$ and $t>0$,
