{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:36:16.007888+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a8d29c915bfd9f97854609d7bae5ae77f064d25d4709c889c1eac703ca382b28","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma conclusion of arXiv:2606.27844, 'Critical percolation on preferential attachment graphs with infinite variance'] We have
