{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:59:24.054768+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a8d30aba623a611623493d33a9cd86e68070690bbbe5d9efe5ae93ff0a6a0c4c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:full-Jacobi-inverse of arXiv:2608.30904, 'Entire monotone solutions of the anisotropic Allen--Cahn equation in dimension 5'] For any $\gamma\in(\mu,1-\mu)$ and $k\ge0$,
