{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:35:10.786334+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a8d63975978553d0475e2d8f8f57039095a1d7d2933377da97f0be214daeed3b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 11 of arXiv:2604.00598, 'Allowing for Imprecision in the Game-theoretic Characterisation of the Poisson Process'] For all \(s,t\in\posreals\) such that \(s\leq t\) and \(g\in\bfns\),
