{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:48:30.901106+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a8d7c560eeebb96ffe2ca6203369736a399b0f3f643aca11041fbadfcbe80d6e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 19 of arXiv:2609.00867, '2609.00867'] Let \(g=g_{d,s}^{(m)}\), where \(m=0\) when \(s=0\), and let
