{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:04:07.030294+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a8d8733ff563b25b08ebc713ffb7a27fc13a29355861a8299fb3317a4870c598","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition of arXiv:2607.29330, 'Large deviations for the maximum of\\ the generalized TAP free energy'] Let $q$, $\eta$, $\mathbf{a}$, $f$, and $g$ satisfy the assumptions of
