{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:57:49.848521+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a8dbe9ec16999f639ebe8ef464dc4075cdb9a10fe11000ba1bb9a4dd54b4cd99","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:ProbabilityRatio of arXiv:2410.23915, 'Asymptotic Bounds and Online Algorithms for Average-Case Matrix Discrepancy'] Let $R_k(\delta)$ be defined as in (equation eq:ProbabilityRatio of the paper). For $0 < k < n$ holds
