{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:05:57.812442+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a8f95e0eacf6bd33af610a843771113693b3de49c51f78fe924650030e995e51","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 11 of arXiv:2608.30570, '2608.30570'] On a surface $\Sigma$ in ${\mathbb R}^4$, we have
