Optimizing in $m$ gives
\begin{equation}
 \Vert\widehat\Xi_n-\Xi_0\Vert_{L^2(I)} = O_{\Prob}\left( (b_n\log n/n)^{\beta/(2\beta+3)} \right).
\end{equation} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

