{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:38:25.217087+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a9db9d2794da25521a20bb06a1b6a24b8ed9d8dd65aa4d694e7fa72f17eef148","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition of arXiv:2609.00233, 'A survey on mapping class groups of 3-manifolds'] We define
