	where $\mathscr{K} \subset \mathscr{G}$ also $\mu$ is an arbitrary $\mathscr{MNC}$  and $ Q \in \mathcal{Q}, \;\delta \in \Delta\; $ and $\mathscr{E}\in\mathbb{E}.$ Also $ F : \mathbb{R}_{+} \rightarrow \mathbb{R}_{+}$ is non-decreasing continuous function.
