{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:37:25.878761+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a9e3bf1b47a9f6105faf311beb327e887477caa7f6715650ff38db3731da4900","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 20 of arXiv:2608.29501, 'Disorder Thresholds and Free Energy of Brownian Directed Polymers with\\ Product and Radia'] Assume \(\kappa=2\), and suppose that \(0\le V\le C_VG_{\bm\alpha}\).
