{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:22:39.565769+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_aa0e12c783e90401a4a9c7e3339d3dcea36b682426ed66a6df574287532897b5","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:moments_bounded_below_by_M of arXiv:2508.18807, '{\bf Critical long-range percolation I: High effective dimension}'] The inequality
