{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:54:15.660648+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_aa91ea1c9688d1f8b2b2c15f623de1ffe9e1ce9f8febcaf80a9e0319bf2ea157","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 15 of arXiv:2608.09700, 'A general paracontrolled ansatz for singular SPDEs'] For any $\tau\in \mcB \sqcup \mcB^+$,
