{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:29:21.940078+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_aaba9a6695cb137d9135c00f8d538a713b5911071ba7d5bde46532e465e29942","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 3 (Second-order logarithmically tempered limit) of arXiv:2608.01674, '\textbf{Limit Theorems for Tempered Linear Processes with Innovations in the Domain of Att'] Let \cref{ass:innovations,ass:filter} hold and assume
