{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:25:40.047108+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_aac33f0ba64031ec55b2e2dc04f8e26b5ce0bb2356fef18537d4aecefba10e68","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 13 of arXiv:2510.24562, 'Hard wall repulsion for the discrete Gaussian free field in random environment on $\mathbb'] For every $\omega \in \Omega_{\lambda,\Lambda}$, $x \in \bbZ^d$ and $N \in \bbN$
