{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:38:36.894845+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_aaed4e38aae93688f1e3d272e96d13545b38150f636d1ff9811be8653237a382","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma fractionleib of arXiv:2606.31155, 'The well-posedness of stochastic Korteweg--de Vries equations revisited'] Let $s\geq 0$, $u\in H^s_x$. We have 
