\item(Hermitian case)Let $\theta=(a_1,\ldots,a_n),\psi,\psi_1,\ldots,\psi_k$ be sequences (finite or infinite) of square of real numbers $b_j^2,(b_j^{(1)})^2,\ldots,(b_j^{(k)})^2$ such that
