        &\quad + \frac{p(p - 1)}{2} \int_0^{t} \|u(s)\|_q^{2r}\int_\mathcal{O} \sum_{i=1}^\infty b_i^2 |u(s)|^{p} \, dx \, ds.
    \end{align} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:39:11.688470+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_abad2c381a77c0241ca98d8c40723c14c50ec19f514e90cdb651a26b8a685de4","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 99 (Corewise trace-variation convergence) of arXiv:2608.04993, '2608.04993'] On $G_*^\Gamma$, $Q$ has finite variation in trace norm and
