{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:45:17.710852+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_abcbe94dc40a728cc8e0145a46628ffed75a0fdf6e103c0e19650a2b24923ec6","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemmaJM of arXiv:2604.11212, 'Sofic measures'] A probability measure~$\mu$ on~$A^\mathbb{Z}$ is~$1$-step Markov if and only if
