{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:43:45.379692+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_abd4eb8e818c07ad730ebc2bcd38e666cb64c393a3b8f30867e7ea4914f02b0a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 20 of arXiv:2609.03993, 'The Endpoint Fractional Riesz Estimate on the Hamming Cube'] Let $2<q<\infty$ and set
