{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:34:33.548365+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_abe145724501b57c336c833f96abfae74991ef6a9342312a2cc91f6dbc1176ce","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 10 of arXiv:2603.29473, '$\chi^2$--cut-off phenomenon for Galerkin projections of Fokker--Planck equations with mon'] Let $f(x) = V'(x) = |x|^\gamma$ and $v$ be as in \cref{lem:WKBprime} for some $\gamma > 0$. Then
