{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:59.500008+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ac042f725c49bcb78ba4f99807b0c036d96b0438bd00533191ca247dfb67e11b","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 18 of arXiv:2605.10150, 'Rough path theory and an introduction to rough partial differential equations'] We introduce the following two paths:
\begin{enumerate}
