{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:51:30.072477+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ac07125dfe58985b3ffec54ffe331a54736f80f8661f42822ba26f6b00f967fa","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 27 of arXiv:2606.01832, 'MA(1) processes with uniform innovations conditioned to stay positive in the non-expanding'] In the orange region, for $0\le m\le p$, it holds
