{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:54:28.123502+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ac2bb4c5f9e1e1fbb9d30b9ada43a4cc6647ab7fc9baf8fe50556a0d6d93ce00","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition Proximal parent of arXiv:2608.13716, 'Graph Causal Optimal Transport \\ and Wasserstein Distances'] We define the \emph{proximal parent map} $\mathrm{prox} : V \to V$ by
