{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:56:37.665473+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ac481e705ee23a3b169d68a39d5f15c809c439bea7d4377ff3997b1416e32217","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem finite-direction-renewal-bound of arXiv:2609.00110, 'Phase Transition and Fluctuation Results for First-Passage Percolation on Spread-Out Cycle'] For every fixed $\beta\geqslant0$ and $\eta>0$, there are constants
