{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:42:47.757745+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ac5041c420ca37f70175e8e8a6b19c09699c546e5b5f26ba5df2d820623b2c56","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 9 of arXiv:2604.11921, 'Replica symmetry up to the de Almeida--Thouless line in the Sherrington--Kirkpatrick model'] \label[proposition]{prop:m-diffusion}
