{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:59:24.054553+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ac6d1a2a19487c647be1ad6f0b63acbffbcc3f60ccea8e411e0a194b0c597c7a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:Psi-structure of arXiv:2608.30904, 'Entire monotone solutions of the anisotropic Allen--Cahn equation in dimension 5'] In the frame $\{e_0,e_x,e_y\}$,
