{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:47:07.717007+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ac97e18e6a3eddd45b42955c3af935ba5f1c3d9f6ea9d631b18860ba5136dbac","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 12 (Uniform full-tangent flow-jet expansion) of arXiv:2608.06393, 'Intrinsic Tangential Hadamard Differentiability of Rough-BSDE Solution Maps'] Assume \(H_i\in C_b^9(\mathbb R)\).  Fix
