{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:43:53.637812+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_acf1ff60006d27a00be67f64543eb62aecea0e52fd75720f38f15d566ecbba68","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:cut_bij of arXiv:2512.17747, 'On exponentially height-penalized random trees'] Let $n\geq1$ and $x\in\mathbb Z$.
