{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:18:19.427440+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ad09a0e98c48a98bd31354e3a9cb9b6ee250a6297356f8a0c039127fa25247cc","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:technical of arXiv:2508.03577, 'Phase Transitions in a Particle Model\\ for the Self-Adaptive Response to Cancer Dynamics'] Let $T$ be the collection time in the coupon collector's problem with $M$ coupons, where we draw according to an exponential random clock with parameter $q$. We then have that
