{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:10:08.737322+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ad2a146acccc62c63b9ce2bb4beb5c88c4ec5c69c2205220d5d13069f8874e43","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma entropy_estimate of arXiv:2411.17653, 'Exclusion processes with non-reversible boundary: hydrodynamics and large deviations'] {There exist $C>0$, such that
