{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:59:24.045938+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ad480ebd3ee81bb9dc804f08737e9b055a7e3e98213bdfaa3577dfae2bfb8ec3","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:compact-plateau of arXiv:2608.30700, 'Convex hulls and area minimizing currents in asymptotically locally hyperbolic manifolds'] For every $t\geq a$, there exists $T_t \in \mathbf{I}_p(M)$ with
