{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:57:07.309549+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ad7dd85807fd594649673a151ca28cde05da727cda77f3381563a690db3c9ef1","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 9 of arXiv:2606.24485, 'On the convex hull of a planar Brownian bridge with a random Gaussian endpoint'] For $0\le\sigma\le1$,
