{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:01:39.414977+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ade05c08ef2a78cd1377330d40c268fa1941112eaa471f42e47bf3906744b1ea","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition LDP- of arXiv:2607.21862, '\bf Uniform Large Deviations of Mckean-Vlasov Stochastic Fractional $(\alpha,p)$-Laplacian'] (Dembo-Zeitouni uniform LDP [Dembo])
We say the family $\{Y^\epsilon_y: \epsilon>0,\ y\in\mathfrak{E}_0\}$ satisfies the Dembo-Zeitouni uniform LDP in $\mathfrak{E}$ with rate functions $\mathcal{I}_y:\mathfrak{E}
\rightarrow[0,\infty]$ uniformly
on $\mathfrak{E}_0$ if the following two
conditions are fulfilled:

(i) For every open subset $G\subseteq\mathfrak{E}$, we have
\begin{align*}
\liminf_{\epsilon\rightarrow0}
\inf_{y\in\mathfrak{E}_0}\Big(\epsilon \ln
\mathbf{P}\big\{ Y^\epsilon_y\in G\big\}         \Big)\geqslant -\sup_{y\in\mathfrak{E}_0}\inf_{\psi\in G}     \mathcal{I}_y(\psi).
\end{align*}

(ii) For every closed subset $F\subseteq\mathfrak{E}$, we have
\begin{align*}
\limsup_{\epsilon\rightarrow0}
\sup_{y\in\mathfrak{E}_0}\Big(\epsilon \ln
\mathbf{P}\big\{ Y_y^\epsilon\in F      \big\}         \Big)\leqslant-\inf_{y\in\mathfrak{E}_0}\inf_{\psi\in F}     \mathcal{I}_y(\psi).
\end{align*}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:45:05.608924+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ade0f8db2119b8f93b47c21506ef1565bc9bb44362b83dffcbfad7a2e7541b51","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 12 of arXiv:2608.05842, 'Asymptotic Expansion of the Kallianpur–Striebel Formula under Perturbations of Linear Mode'] Let $X.$ and $\xi.0$ be the paths of $\{X_s\}_{0\leq s\leq t}$ and $\{\xi_{s,t}\}_{0\leq s\leq t}$, and $\mu_X$ and $\mu_{\xi}$ be their distributions on $P$. 
  \begin{align*}     
    \frac{d\mu_{\xi}}{d\mu_X}(X.)=\exp\biggl( &-\frac{1}{2}\int_0^t X_s^\top S(s) X_sds\\
    &-\frac{1}{2}\int_0^t b(s)^\top \phi(s;t)b(s)ds-\frac{1}{2}X_0^\top \phi(0;t) X_0\biggr).
