{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:18:13.238926+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ae232167445fb7935aaacfe637e6b85815b227e27b555d96e7c44c60dc032c11","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eq:finL2 of arXiv:2506.17168, '{\bf Scaling limits for sample autocovariance operators of Hilbert space-valued linear pro'] Recall the kernel $\mathfrak{f}$ from (equation equality_f^(u,l)_t,(m,s) of the paper) and let $d(r) \in \left(\frac{1}{4},\frac{1}{2} \right)$. If 
