{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:31:57.898421+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_aed071906d15f13984c26546307d2f9893bdda28ca64a5165afadafc2e09c336","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:general-hu of arXiv:2510.18392, 'Hyperuniformity of random measures, transport and rigidity'] Let $ \mathsf{M}$ a $ L^{ 2}_{ loc}$ weakly stationary random measure~with spectral measure $ \mathsf{S}$. The three following are equivalent.\begin{itemize}
