{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:13:18.516155+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_aed5f1a3b66748d913a659b6e38696846ced0d49f7cbd42bfe3e3d68a13b2fa1","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 21 of arXiv:2608.30602, '2608.30602'] Assume $|v(x)|\lesssim\langle x\rangle^{-3-}$. Then for $m=1,2$ we have the decomposition
