{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:58:38.147458+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_aedde13fcb8b7583a181f9e8ba3239a5e25c78d84701edad5786e2349ba708f7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:minima of arXiv:2606.24465, 'History estimation in random recursive trees:\\Pointwise approach via iterated Jordan cent'] Let $v\geq 2$. Then
