{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:33:01.771659+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_aeff0a9a9bc4bed3df7bf6a3bdfb39882d5aa25fe383537f1bb0393a5b5c7ec8","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 18 (Count-chain transition) of arXiv:2605.14511, 'Clumsy and Careless:\\ Stationary-Entry Flux in Non-monotone Coupon Collectors'] The process $K_t$ is a Markov chain on $\{0,1,\ldots,n\}$. Its transition rule is
