{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:47:07.715343+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_af21a6f8b56ae89f6c874a3647120ee4cecaa17a6d94ec3c7188f133b1d03674","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 1 (Tensor model of the tangent fibre) of arXiv:2608.06393, 'Intrinsic Tangential Hadamard Differentiability of Rough-BSDE Solution Maps'] For $\mathbf x\in WG\Omega_p(E)$, let $\mathbb T_{\mathbf x}^p$ be the
