{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:18:19.234780+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_af294e385b5012903cb440259ce8d0a35423d2d350f6faefc66ab9c04bb9f36e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 66 (Potential function $\alpha_{Cone\ A}$) of arXiv:2608.29086, '2608.29086'] Given $Cone\ A \in CONE(H_0)$. A potential function $\alpha_{Cone\ A} \in C^0(H_0)$ is obtained by
