{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:16:53.611288+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_af2e4ad57769abf79e0a789cc2e1e497a2edeea05cecabd9d6de0d2ef239f708","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:psi_lb of arXiv:2412.05491, 'Near-critical and finite-size scaling for \\ high-dimensional lattice trees and animals'] Let $d >8$, $L \ge L_0$,
