{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:38:57.118949+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_af4ba45161ae44013a8c19cd7ec9744dbbb7d0de5337908c089e9b70fc29c6ad","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 37 of arXiv:2604.04823, '2604.04823'] Suppose~$\underline \epsilon < \bar \epsilon$ and~$\nu \in (0, 1/\underline \epsilon)$. Set
