{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:56:14.332093+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_af6b2ce5c9eb47c7144aedb2f2295f293f90c8d2d1e1bed3e3aa6961d0221237","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defi def:increasing_kernel of arXiv:2412.10001, 'On the Markov transformation of Gaussian processes'] \begin{enumerate}
