{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:02:08.132875+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_afb7c14ba9cbcdadb812faae53c3452c73e7ae3680e1075d5004442d593e3b62","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 1 of arXiv:2608.27569, 'Laplace and Dolbeault operators on Sasakian manifolds'] Let $(M^{2n+1},g,\xi )$ be a Sasakian manifold. The Dolbeault Laplacians $\Delta
