{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:55:42.110723+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_afed70c48e191de964e5f2fccf6d93d2e3542c8b1cea7af2beb47fc45a1469ea","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Taylor of arXiv:2411.15881, 'Stable Approximation for Call Function Via Stein's method'] Let $X$ have a distribution of the form ((px of the paper)) and $B(x)$ satisfy ((bound of the paper)) with $\gamma\in(0,2-\alpha]$. Let
