	\lim_{T \rightarrow \infty} \mathcal Z_T^\sigma(f\mid \varphi^{\sigma,0}_-,\varphi^{\sigma,0}_+) = \mathcal Z^\sigma(f \mid \varphi^{\sigma,0}_-,\varphi^{\sigma,0}_+).
