\item[(iii)] For every $f \in C^\infty(M^\sigma)$, we have that $-\log \mathcal Z^\sigma(f \mid \varphi^{\sigma,0}_-,\varphi^{\sigma,0}_+)$ is given by an explicit variational problem. 
