{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:11:35.820613+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b0bb150ca0bafaa0a38e0e6d88f7d8971b8ed9c588e9cab24c6e4239113c6f85","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:horizontal_decoupling of arXiv:2607.22908, 'Epidemic Phase Transitions in the Zero-Range Process'] There are constants
