{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:38:23.514703+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b0e0efd2cd4e26d95da0c9e0c0d0d9f1d1b29b9ae61f44de9b4bbfd4037cc388","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem \cite{Sarrazin}, Thm. 3 of arXiv:2510.18392, 'Hyperuniformity of random measures, transport and rigidity'] Let $ P$ a point configuration on $ \T$ with $ N$ distinct points.
