{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:52:05.686053+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b0ebc26edd39b772cb265c32048ea20499bc93ff6d2e1d17376545e7e309cc34","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Mainthm t:1.3i of arXiv:2602.21277, 'A Limit in Law for the Cover Time and Last Visited Vertex of Wired Planar Domains'] The joint law of $\widecheck{{\mathbf T}}_{\rm D}$, $\widecheck{{\mathbf X}}_{\rm D}$ from Theorem~(t:1.1 of the paper) is given by
