{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:49:06.331867+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b0f73163e2198db26aba0d46803b8ba6814f5702e5e640c859b71f4f6e83824f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:FreeFieldTalagrand of arXiv:2601.19630, 'Mass generation for the two dimensional O(N) Linear Sigma Model in the large N limit'] Let $s>0$.  For any $\rho \in \mathcal{P}([H^{-s}(\Lambda_{L})]^N)$ the following inequality holds
