{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:43:53.606016+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b15e33cfcd8b5ffbaac5d4a5573db090d9741b4a484d0cead1657eb350aa482d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:extsphere:interiorcone of arXiv:2512.13200, 'Martingales on a Euclidean manifold with a boundary and reflected BSDEs in non-convex doma'] $ $
