{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:54:18.300027+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b1e93fb166776d9e0bf07b3f466cd4067d2aef27b6cecc0177ef5d253ffcacec","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma le:moment_bound of arXiv:2608.30382, 'Convergence rates for the RMSprop optimizer with full control of the hyperparameters'] Let $ c, q, \rho \in (0,\infty) $, $ p \in [1,\infty) $, $ \beta \in (0,1) $ satisfy
