{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:48:30.899641+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b206ea4138d5607d33a5af2fae5e77b5074cb90bea98f716d9bc5c4c4a2ee877","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 9 of arXiv:2609.00867, '2609.00867'] For every \(\beta>0\) and \(p>1\), we have
