{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:51:11.634697+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b21b97cf3ccf303581919b2657cd1e8c310b157d378e6426049551bb0a1d8af1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 19 of arXiv:2605.31088, 'On couplings for kinetic Langevin diffusions'] Assume that $\gamma^2>4\alpha\geq 0$ and assume $  \lambda_{-} \Delta x - \Delta v =0$ and $\Delta x\neq 0$. 
