	where we recall $D^\pi_{KL}$ is the $\pi$-weighted KL divergence, $c_{KL}$ is the KL-divergence Dobrushin coefficient as in Definition (equation def:KLDobrushin of the paper), $\mathrm{SLEM}$ as in (equation def:SLEMP of the paper), while $V$ and $\overline{v}$ are respectively the worst-case (equation eq:worstasympvar of the paper) and average-case (equation eq:averageasympvar of the paper) asymptotic variance. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

