{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:51:52.053746+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b2a713d68f0847eb62d1687fbc9e9a1dd29c1065c4d3f16f4768f9ad9105e7da","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lm lacomp of arXiv:2607.12795, 'Semi-open boundary for random walking shocks'] \begin{multline}
