{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:23:27.792547+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b2d27e992d950a3eac2286f5cc0bc9b76915d008e81b8d4fdbe34abf28640730","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm t.PT_of_functions of arXiv:2606.11043, 'Thick points under Gaussian free field dynamics'] Let $\Phi$ be an OU-GFF in $D\subseteq \mathbb C$, then:
