{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:07:15.775118+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b31c8b6d2a14a4de55d0f484b6419076f6058364557b685474c4bce5ee3b8bb7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:topline of arXiv:2608.05089, 'Correlation decay in area-tilted line ensembles'] For any fixed $\eta > 0$ and $\lambda_0 > 1$, there are some $H > 0$ and
