{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:07:35.012874+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b34579538664f30b5568b87052d1bbdd6d374f9f4c6012c0781f86ee1c3ce638","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 55 of arXiv:2609.02850, 'Canonical-row Chern flow on Bott--Samelson towers:\\ realizable-volume models for Schubert'] For $1\le t\le c_a$, there is an exact sequence
