{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:38:04.525840+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b39f112801d460a366803c24aca3e2028b2ee7bbf0252a44e6be162e0dbc75f5","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma of arXiv:2607.18011, 'From local giants to locality in long-range percolation'] \thlabel{lem:transience_geometry}
