{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:21:28.735240+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b4121d1463ff5161f106c675888f45c1b08f96958bc65532708c03dbab7a2c6d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma l:mostly-lc-var of arXiv:2605.03718, 'Potential Hessian Ascent III:\\ Sampling the Sherrington--Kirkpatrick Model at $\beta < 1/'] Let $L, \alpha>0$. 
