{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:29:23.336939+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b422bb603577d7e62f86eb53cb0faa9605c5a2a80a6c9f0a2c7b5567c93b2934","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 49 of arXiv:2512.05466, 'Stochastic Flows and Marked Stable Processes'] Define a mapping $\ki \colon [0,\infty) \to \bR_+\times \bR$ by 
