{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:06:18.022388+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b4b6113b527166aef57fcc63faa6615f7023b49b50056b88aca3326035c89249","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 8 of arXiv:2608.15379, 'Stochastic Jacobi fields along discontinuous martingales on Riemannian submanifolds'] Let $\bJ=(X,J)$ be a $TM$-valued semimartingale and $\wilde{\cV}$ a $TTM$-valued adapted \cl process above $\bJ$.
