{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:06:07.090782+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b5195af761284d237979ca936f6eb5d4fa4570a9b2d92ebaeb75db7e7c0d3dc2","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 29 of arXiv:2608.28148, 'Flows and homotopies of Banach Lie algebroids'] Let $\mathcal{X}$ be  a vector field on $E_{U}$.  The following properties are equivalent:
