{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:49:17.495956+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b53064837130085620014fa585fc9926cf4d636c7dd3ec6ed17e37f9b3365d1b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 5 of arXiv:2605.28801, 'Microscopic Weak Selection Principle for the Logistic Branching Brownian Motion with selec'] Consider the function $\psi(x) := 6x^5-15x^4+10x^3$ and define a sequence of functions 
