{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:00:30.501332+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b566023403eb369ff27f0745285d046029a1b26dbb31b422475f39100a48d678","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Problem 16 (Townes certificate target) of arXiv:2607.04467, 'Bernstein Functions at Work:\\ Coalescents, Copulas, and Subordination'] For \(\eta=10^{-4}\), set
