{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:54:57.600161+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b57955d5670be6ada7eb7298b513d9e60832435db86a9049570f4ade17cf39fd","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:import of arXiv:2412.03450, 'On intermediate levels of nested occupancy scheme in random environment generated by stick'] Let $\alpha$, $\beta$, $C$ and $D$ be as in (equation eq:estim of the paper). For $t\geq 0$ and positive integer $j$ satisfying
\begin{equation}
2D\Gamma(\beta+1)j(\alpha(j-1)+\beta+1)^{\alpha-\beta}\leq C\Gamma(\alpha+1)t^{\alpha-\beta},
\end{equation}
the following inequality holds
\begin{equation*} 
