{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:31:57.915023+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b58769fa2add79d3158a74fd24d14e760a9c6b3ccab5f73a9698b5e6f0f75cf1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:reprod-kernels of arXiv:2510.18392, 'Hyperuniformity of random measures, transport and rigidity'] For a  reproducing kernel $ K$ on $ \mathbb{R}^{ d}\times \mathbb{R}^{ d}$ such that 
