{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:28:34.923168+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b597a0920fd86e7b8f6b795291cf3ce328fc6289dd7b852e95c43541dd6fcf2c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop_relation_pointandboundary of arXiv:2412.05706, 'Quasi-multiplicativity and regularity for metric graph Gaussian free fields'] For any $d\ge 3$, there exist constants $
