{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:27:32.350968+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b597cd2d62b081aadff478a56af5aaf4b987953527d1cae7e5c1bc734811b264","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma_steinmethod_xmorethanu_gendif of arXiv:2509.18045, 'Density convergence on Markov diffusion chaos via Stein's method'] Fix  $x\geq u$ and $k\in \mathbb{N}$. Let the function $h$ in the ODE (equation equation_stein of the paper) be 
