	\end{enumerate} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:38:36.894912+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b6618b106e63b0189d35af93ee7bfd6e322cdf7527478875b7c55681223b0cbd","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma stochasticesti of arXiv:2606.31155, 'The well-posedness of stochastic Korteweg--de Vries equations revisited'] Let $s \in \mathbb{R}$, $0\leq 
