\]","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:45:02.036137+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b666f6d6ee940a62a831044e470a902964bb7982cee228f1d7f3a9ea4a127400","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma of arXiv:2512.23957, 'Concentration and fluctuations of sine-Gordon measure around topological multi-soliton man'] Let $F$ be a bounded, continuous function. Then
