{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:42:55.322188+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b6b1a0496fc8065321d2af6e9d02c9108c608ca3b0076f30f056c7387c26b106","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 40 (Finite-window Kearns--Saul inequality) of arXiv:2609.02398, '\textbf{Convex Order Comparisons for Sub-Gamma Random Variables}'] {Let $p\in(0,1/2]$ and $a>0$. The inequality}
