{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:46:36.095270+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b6c52ec2b33a7e59160d48f30a1611c7340f503447e80ddb45e425824ddd9ac8","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem lem_loc of arXiv:2609.02795, 'Global smooth behavior in Kuznetsov and Westervelt type\\ viscous wave equations:\\ A unif'] Suppose that $h\in \bigcup_{\iota>0} C^{1+\iota}_{loc} (\mathbb{R}^2)$ and
