{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:53:11.419240+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b708ead1e743197700bb17bbac9ef3ca3a7a96c83f4620cb82cd5a8227941ab7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 21 (Covariance formula for the Skorohod integral, {\cite[Proposition 3.1) of arXiv:2606.08776, 'Approximation of certain stochastic integrals with anticipating integrands'] {Nualart:Zakai:1986}}, {\cite[(1.54) on page 42]{Nualart:book:2006}}]

