{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:38:23.528814+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b74e36b7a68d989baaf3e343b0ae705534c0f63e5d807ee500c26b3d699b3f0c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Lww of arXiv:2510.22701, 'Gaussian fluctuations in Mean Field Stable matchings'] If $d>1$ and $\kappa_n\geqslant \log^4 n$, then, for $1\leqslant k\leqslant m_n$ and $r\in \mathbbm{N}$, we have that
