{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:53:54.821455+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b74edb71581d622c861c58869ca89e75dd4c72f1f2fc88e5563807c22b0cdb1d","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 4 (The $\varphi$-transform) of arXiv:2607.16833, 'Dynamical Equations for Poisson Galton--Watson Trees and Component Densities of Sparse Inh'] For every $u>0$, on finite typed trees rooted at type $x$,
\begin{equation}
