{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:22:39.709587+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b7665216fd1115d112cbd5c8ae8c1c969feed93989c12ae7d604f651aea2e8cb","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma l:2) of arXiv:2508.21658, 'Infinite-dimensional stochastic differential equations for Coulomb random point fields'] For all $ \rR \ge \qQ + 1 $, 
\begin{align}  
