{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:59.503309+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b7c32c0e24c1f08bce7ae0e506d6e73015bffaf40464e983e0629025a056eba3","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 62 of arXiv:2605.10150, 'Rough path theory and an introduction to rough partial differential equations'] We introduce the following notions:
