{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:49:05.461322+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b7fcf4b160080b8333f78b610c2f9ff7b77870ce143ea6c5c05c7f4ea29cd79b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem comparison-result of arXiv:2601.19145, 'Stochastic Persistence in Infinite Dimensions'] Fix $T > 0$ and assume $f,g: \mathbb{D}([0,T], \mathcal{M}) \to [0,\infty]$ satisfy for all $x \in \mathcal{M}$:
