    $$\limsup_{t \to \infty} \frac{1}{t}\int_0^t \hat f(X_s^x)ds \leq \frac{2}{T}\limsup_{t \to \infty} \frac{1}{t}\int_0^t g_2(\{X_r^x\}_{s\leq r \leq s+T})ds \,.$$","status":"unverified"}

