{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:31:45.220880+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b806d7ff4e0e6c160434d7919e120d4cc9632ad78530b03b087eb29e05085a0b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma saddles of arXiv:2412.06086, 'Zeros of conditional Gaussian analytic functions, random sub-unitary matrices and q-series'] Assume that $x>0$. Let
