{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:13:18.517209+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b8272ed398d6cb7cb958fa26dc3458b93d7f5db32e0c5b2af12c0263ed02c2b5","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 28 of arXiv:2608.30602, '2608.30602'] Let $|V(x)|\lesssim \langle x\rangle^{-6-}$ and suppose that $f_1 \in C^{2}(\mathbb{R})$ satisfies
