{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:47:01.661125+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b84c0246577eb9e2a2ce17cb9950ccb2b9bf4a7c85fa2952a9e6de810c5ecd68","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 6 of arXiv:2604.23572, '2604.23572'] $f_{k-1,0}^{(1)}$ and
$f_{k-1,0}^{(2)}$ ($k \in \K_2^-$) are given by

