{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:35:56.960843+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b8659cc3acd1562b954123c04597e91c4f34332b43880453b02ed23c7deb054a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma E[weak-sl]_asymp of arXiv:2604.05921, 'Simplicity of random hypergraphs'] If $\forall e \in E: \delta_e^{\textnormal{tail}} = \delta^{\textnormal{tail}}\in O(1)$ and $\delta_e^{\textnormal{head}} = \delta^{\textnormal{head}}\in O(1)$ and 
