{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:02:38.606279+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b867c2407eb1e8a52d8f3b50f9ce8cb2794b3a56fb461a2e651ef39a553ba2db","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 13 of arXiv:2607.08129, '2607.08129'] Let $h:[0,1]\to\R$ be bounded and Riemann integrable.  Then
