{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:31:57.917969+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b87bf3d1eae8816a0c1c258ae3ed668baed154e4dad39b57c7932f8db763935b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:DFHL of arXiv:2510.18392, 'Hyperuniformity of random measures, transport and rigidity'] Assume $ \mathbf E \|U_{ k}\|^{ 2}<\infty $. Then \begin{itemize}
