\item In dimension $ d \geqslant 3$, for every $ \varepsilon >0,$ there exists a stationary field $    \mathsf U$ with $ \|U_{ {  \bf k}}\|<\varepsilon $ a.s. and $ R^{ -d}  \textrm{Var}\left(   \mathsf Z^{d, \mathsf U}(B_{ R})\right)\to \infty .$
