{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:02:34.826695+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b89c6b3594c3fc1062a18ee19de199cb73c42444c6ea439b386afbb24bcd2685","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 39 (Reduced covariance negative moments) of arXiv:2607.19752, 'Weak Equilibrium Measures and Capacity--Hitting Identities\\ for the Hypoelliptic Third-Or'] Set
