The infimum of the empty set is infinity. If \(V_X(t)=0\), set \(C_X(t)=0\).","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:49:17.503461+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b8a934b919d6035b901516331588995126aa9bb05ac9d25a9f85c1f4614ee2a0","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 33 of arXiv:2605.30030, 'Critical exponents for planar random-cluster model with cluster-weight~$q=4$'] Fix~$\calG$  a well-separated outer flower domain on~$\Lambda_{4|y|}$ and write~$\xi < \xi'$ for its compatible boundary conditions.
