\item[$(iii)$] any accumulation point $(\mu^{*}_{t})_{t \in [0,T]}$ is in $\mathcal{C}([0,T], (\mathcal{M}_{1+ \mathrm{Id} + \omega}(\mathbb{R}^{*}_{+}),\mathrm{w}))$.
