{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:43:00.052286+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b8d7503f7fc4de2693ed3b750333c873b4125110c391d8382967e6ae2039856d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 5 of arXiv:2609.00810, 'Uniqueness and Stability of Monge--Amp\`ere potentials in Big Cohomology Classes'] Let $u$ be a $\theta$-psh function and define the Kiselman-Legendre transform with level $c$ by
