{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:15:55.000460+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b8fb3ab87ee198661292dc688e8cdfe8b060f8a72770dc93776b713996b8c869","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:i-subset-e of arXiv:2608.29708, 'Intuitionistic and Constructive Modal Logics for Classical Modal Logicians'] $\mathcal{V}^i \subseteq \mathcal{V}^e$.
