{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:22:39.538965+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b8fb8870304b3ce00346fc8af03496d4f7a6f02313f5b52951e50d841431582b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:hd_moments_main of arXiv:2508.18807, '{\bf Critical long-range percolation I: High effective dimension}'] Suppose that at least one of the three hypotheses of (equation HD of the paper) holds.

