{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:09:23.960508+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b900a55f81995283e7bc25ddffa2dc5bec2538fb3739ebdf595927cdde989be5","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 7 of arXiv:2607.22362, 'A Small-Noise Analysis of Controlled Functional Differential Equations with Gaussian Noise'] For all $\varepsilon > 0$, 
