{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:42:55.314397+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b90d637e601d7c12b26a12e22cd22afba16239f9a456d40eb73c45811d4818a8","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 14 (Binding sign) of arXiv:2609.02398, '\textbf{Convex Order Comparisons for Sub-Gamma Random Variables}'] Let $p \in (0, 1/2]$, $\nu > 0$ and $\lambda > 0$. Then
