{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:04:55.805221+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b9624c31f0b56136fc162cdbb85fa02e12f96d1aab9fd6210b27312410ac6214","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemm l:ito-isometry of arXiv:2607.18194, 'Temperature chaos in directed polymers'] For every $s<t$ and $x,x',y,y'\in\mathbb{R}$,
