		\end{equation}
	\end{longlist}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:49:15.410634+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b980e6efda1baa894d0982e5f7672a41c9d3c0ae7935c40736b5bd92686a4dfe","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem Fiberwise estimate theorem of arXiv:2608.27248, 'Optimal Transport and the ABP Method in Higher Codimension'] Assume the hypotheses of Theorem (Inverse transport theorem of the paper) with
