		\end{align}
		For some fixed integer $d\in\mathbb{N}^+$, suppose $\mathbf{x}_j\stackrel{\mathrm{i.i.d.}}{\sim}\mathcal{N}_d(\bm{0},\Sigma)$ for $j=1,\cdots,n$, with $\Sigma$ as in (equation eq:2.1.0 of the paper). Moreover, for $\delta$ in (equation eq:2.1 of the paper), we assume that
