    \end{enumerate}
    Then, as $n \rightarrow \infty$, 
    $$ \bm T(\bm H_n) \dto \bm Z, $$
            where $\bm T(\bm H_n) $ and $\bm Z$ are as defined in Proposition (ppn:dmultiplegraphs of the paper).  \hfill $\Box$ (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

