{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:12:46.876265+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b9ddb89bc11ba9933bd6a6ce6e276180c7b1cbe01b4c0a0661f2c3708dd3861d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:word-cost of arXiv:2608.09368, 'A proof of Ross's conjecture for two-site moving-target search'] The expected search cost of following the sequence $w$ until either the
