{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:14:46.359672+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b9f1613faa43e388f66bce2394e935d29b24ccfdc7d7e19daf6846f44eb0cd7c","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem of arXiv:2608.10415, 'Continuous random variables'] When rolling a usual die $n$ times in a row:
