{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:59:53.169038+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ba088351f6c132decb073231e27c9695becb8ef773416d9209e33d67fede04c8","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 22 (Mixed Moment Bound) of arXiv:2607.03318, 'Continuous Differentiability of the Value Function for Infinite-Dimensional Finite-Horizon'] Let Assumption \ref{ass:coefficients} hold. Define the \emph{spatial variation weight} $W: H \times H \to \R$ by:
