{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:22:01.647268+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ba3d03c34d2364ae43d90c21df01ff6f25c4789b4c94f1890b5c4a56bfe41af8","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm-well-posedness of arXiv:2603.01823, 'on a fractional stochastic heat equation arising from the disordered pinning model'] Concerning the mild Skorohod solution to the SHE (equation e:she of the paper) in the sense of Definition~(def: solution of the paper), we have the following results:
\begin{enumerate}
