{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:20:55.560172+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ba419fdd2516eadfdc89c7a6472e6674b7afca7877f4896eacb5426ec8ef276d","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition Number operator/Ornstein-Uhlenbeck operator of arXiv:2411.07680, 'Energy solutions of singular SPDEs on Hilbert spaces with applications to domains with bou'] The {{\em number operator\/}}, also called {{\em Ornstein-Uhlenbeck
