{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:20:15.718644+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ba44983476891513c8b8eb761ad01a7eec718c9651f8a6a2acac3aab97de0c77","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition proposition_estimates_psi_second_derivatives of arXiv:2609.00973, 'The Vlasov-Maxwell point charge system : study of the spherically symmetric case'] Let $t\geq T_0$ and $\mathcal{M}$ be defined as in (equation equation_definition_mathcal_M of the paper). The second order derivatives of $\widetilde{\Psi}$ satisfy
