{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:45:05.368856+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ba4b75ef75f3fd7ea9ad0b8b0ddd4716ef20aad795c0afb41508593cfc850506","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 120 (Covariance-energy fiber) of arXiv:2608.04993, '2608.04993'] For $a\in\mathcal S_1(H)_+$ define
