{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:31:57.917846+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ba679e9816b3e487737ad65ff919cd2cac0ac0c4c9396ea4f676eb2c726d5e6d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem \cite{HartBjo} of arXiv:2510.18392, 'Hyperuniformity of random measures, transport and rigidity'] \begin{itemize}
