      conditional on the event $\{\varsigma^n+\nu^n>\varepsilon\}$ where $\varepsilon>0$ is such that $\mathbb{P}(\varsigma + \nu=\varepsilon) = 0$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

