{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:06:18.024695+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bade252e168307e92283a53bf09257d5f766b72179d68d1507b398ed4fd711da","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 18 of arXiv:2608.15379, 'Stochastic Jacobi fields along discontinuous martingales on Riemannian submanifolds'] Assume that the embedding $\iota \colon M \to \mathbb{R}^d$ is proper.
