{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:22:39.663945+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bb0b107a990ea7d67deea724b38be04f5b4a795955625630426c8bf75d431f59","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:four_point_Gladkov of arXiv:2508.18807, '{\bf Critical long-range percolation I: High effective dimension}'] There exists a universal constant $C$ such that the inequality
\begin{multline*}
