{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:28.474004+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bb5ccb005c7a25bfb52b30d29a480214a82f21841dbab95df01b7f38082b9abf","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 57 (Two-sided block assembly) of arXiv:2606.29292, 'Intrinsic Gaussian Tensor Geometry and Random Operator Spectra'] Let $1\le r\le\infty$ and put
\[
