      \end{equation*}
      In this case, we say that the expression of \eqref{HA-expression0} is independent of the choice of FS $(\tau_n)$ for $\mathbb{C}$.
\end{itemize} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

