{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:07:48.544809+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bbe5c475950b0aad8b8b12eb8d37dcbc43decd9e9a76fb7049e25433ed202590","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 2 (Ensembles with perturbed inputs) of arXiv:2609.01397, 'Measuring consistency via ensemble margin and local prediction variability: Auditing decis'] For a fixed $x$, Rashomon \smallset{} set $\retailset$, and noise realizations $\localtest_j$, for each $j$ we define the ensemble value at $\localtest_j$ by
