          \frac{2\kappa_N}{3}\zeta^\frac{3}{2}(z),~~\frac{2\kappa_{n-1,N}}{3}\zeta^\frac{3}{2}\left(\frac{\tilde{x}_N(s)}{\kappa_{n-1,N}}\right)~~and~~\frac{2\kappa_{n,N-1}}{3}\zeta^\frac{3}{2}\left(\frac{\tilde{x}_N(s)}{\kappa_{n,N-1}}\right)\ge s
