{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:04:07.026086+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bc16cd4730a63435c8e3c8f708d13ede2e525f8f11a0d99e0ad653ec75e58ca4","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:alternating of arXiv:2607.27810, 'Perturbed Beta Corners Process'] Let $n\ge2$, let $t_1>\cdots>t_n$ or $t_1<\cdots<t_n$, and let
$u\in\mathbb R^n$. Then
