{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:59.505232+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bc5bcb5048d941df650a8dc100f6651038e91c5207ad9ea6d777103bc994f274","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 92 of arXiv:2605.10150, 'Rough path theory and an introduction to rough partial differential equations'] The following statements are true:
