{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:51:11.520975+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bc6c4c52f1fabca34186990e42e568ed885880c158681d71d2ccd6f5264c2770","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 10 (Linear maps, sums, and L\'evy time) of arXiv:2609.02595, 'Minimal Radial Sub-Gamma Envelopes for Infinitely Divisible Random Vectors'] Let all random vectors below be centered and have finite second moments.
\begin{enumerate}
