\sup_{t \in [0,T]} \pr \left( \left\lbrace \max_{1 \leq i \leq N}  \left| X^\varepsilon_{N,i} - \bar{X}^\varepsilon_{i} \right|(t) \geq N^{-\alpha} \right\rbrace \right) \leq  \frac{C}{N^\gamma}.
