{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:10.188053+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bcd6a81fbf50c416bb9ec5ad80cce1613b60df70b148b984f3c7c6178d950936","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 144 of arXiv:2605.03236, 'Stochastic It\^o Equations and Parabolic Second-Order Equations with singular Drift'] Suppose that
