{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:35:04.170025+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bd12d3b795bb20e227448a94181a10393da10e3f43ead8768a1586557e26d9c7","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:directional-recurrence of arXiv:2609.00399, 'Shannon's problem on the monotonicity of entropy and a Conjecture of Tao'] Under the hypotheses of Theorem~(thm:transport-cover of the paper), fix
