{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:04:39.795717+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bd4026f8263beba813ed038ce2655318f7aaa20429d975e9cab9ec0f40fdf160","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:tailrl-weight-form of arXiv:2609.02987, 'Tail Likelihood Reinforcement Learning'] For an input $x$, the population-level gradient of TailRL{} is estimable as,
