{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:05:28.236767+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bdec3aa6b43df5c4cbd537869462656514559bff0a665ccb4b2234db64490610","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma convergence of the truncated polymer partition function of arXiv:2602.04429, 'Disordered systems and (subcritical) polynomial chaos\\ with heavy-tail disorder'] {}
